Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.65,0:01:41.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund! Get away from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter! What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter, quickly, the shelter. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:47.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on!  - Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:49.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, leave it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.90,0:01:53.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:57.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:00.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on, quickly!  - Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:02.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.61,0:02:06.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hurry!  - Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Wait! Dad!  - Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.01,0:02:11.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Edmund, no!  - I'll get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:15.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Peter, come back!  - Ed! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:18.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:21.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, you idiot, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:22.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:30.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:37.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why can't you think of anyone but yourself? You're so selfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:41.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You could've got us killed!  - Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:44.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's OK. Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:50.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why can't you just do as you're told?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:04.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Alms for the poor. Alms for the poor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.27,0:03:05.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,God bless you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:07.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Children and evacuation staff...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:11.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You need to keep this on, darling. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You warm enough? Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:18.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Say hello to Auntie Laura. Goodbye, darling, we love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:21.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If Dad were here, he wouldn't make us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:24.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If Dad were here, it'd mean the war was over and we wouldn't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:27.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You will listen to your brother, won't you, Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:45.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Promise me you'll look after the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:46.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I will, Mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:54.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Good man.  - All aboard! All aboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bye, darling!  - Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.85,0:03:59.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:03.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be a big girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:06.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on to your brother's hand. Don't let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:11.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Off you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.57,0:04:15.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- All aboard!  - Bye-bye. Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:23.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, get off. I know how to get on a train by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:30.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,May I have your tickets, please? Tickets, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:31.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:35.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- That's right. On you go.  - Yes. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:40.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come along. Come along this way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:44.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lucy. We have to stick together now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:49.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be all right. It's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:53.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bye, Mommy! I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:09.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Bye-bye, dear.  - Bye! We'll miss you! See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:12.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I love you, Mum! Bye!  - See you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:15.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Write to us, Mum!  - Love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.53,0:06:17.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Goosey Station. Goosey Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:27.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me your hand. Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:32.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The professor knew we were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:35.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Perhaps we've been incorrectly labeled.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:38.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, hup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:46.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And whoa. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:54.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Mrs. Macready?  - I'm afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:59.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this it, then? Haven't you brought anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:02.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:04.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:08.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Small favors.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:14.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Good girl. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:32.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Professor Kirke is not accustomed to havin' children in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:36.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And, as such, there are a few rules we need to follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:38.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There will no shoutin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:43.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or runnin'. No improper use of the dumbwaiter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:46.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No touchin' of the historical artifacts!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:50.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And above all,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:56.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,there shall be no disturbin' of the professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:08.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,German aircraft carried out a number of attacks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:09.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,on Great Britain last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:12.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The raids, Which lasted for several hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.11,0:09:20.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The sheets feel scratchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:25.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wars don't last forever, Lucy. We'll be home soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:29.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yeah, if home's still there.  - lsn't it time you were in bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:31.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yes, Mum.  - Ed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:38.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You saw outside. This place is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:40.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can do whatever we want here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's going to be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:45.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:53.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Gastrovascular."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.48,0:09:58.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Peter. Gastrovascular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:01.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is it Latin?  - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:05.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it Latin for "worst game ever invented"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:10.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We could play hide and seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:14.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But we're already having so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:18.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Peter, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:21.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:26.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- One, two, three, four...  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:30.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...five, six, seven, eight,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:34.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,nine, ten, 1 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:49.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...24, 25, 26...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:06.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was here first!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:14.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...75, 76, 77, 78, 79, 80,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:19.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,81, 82, 83, 84,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:23.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,85, 86, 85, 86, 87, 88...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:27.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...89, 90, 91, 92,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:31.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,93, 94, 95...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:26.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Were you hiding from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:32.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:34.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:37.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:40.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No. I-l-I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:43.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was just, um... I didn't want to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:50.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind my asking... what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.17,0:15:53.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm a... Well, I'm a faun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:55.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:58.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You must be some kind of beardless dwarf?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:01.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not a dwarf! I'm a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:07.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And, actually, I'm tallest in my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:14.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean to say that you're a Daughter of Eve?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, my mum's name is Helen.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:21.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, but you are in fact human.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.67,0:16:24.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:31.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I was hiding in the wardrobe in the spare room, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:33.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Spare Oom? Is that in Narnia?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:36.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Narnia? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:39.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, dear girl, you're in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:42.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything from the lamppost
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:45.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,all the way to Castle Cair Paravel on the Eastern Ocean,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,every stick and stone you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:52.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,every icicle is Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is an awfully big wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:17:00.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,War Drobe? I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:04.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to introduce myself. My name is Tumnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:08.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you, Mr. Tumnus. I'm Lucy Pevensie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:16.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, you shake it.  - Uh... Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:20.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:22.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,People do it when they meet each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:36.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then, Lucy Pevensie from the shining city of War Drobe
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:39.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,in the wondrous land of Spare Oom,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:44.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,how would it be if you came and had tea with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:47.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, thank you very much, but l...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:50.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I probably should be getting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:55.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's only just around the corner. And there'll be a glorious fire
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:59.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,with toast and tea and cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:02.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And, perhaps, we'll even break into the sardines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:06.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't know.  - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.97,0:18:10.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not every day that I get to make a new friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:15.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose I could come for a little while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:17.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you have sardines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.15,0:18:19.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,By the bucketload.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:34.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You all right?  - Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:43.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:53.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- After you.  - May I help you with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:56.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thank you very much.  - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:06.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:16.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, that... that is my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:19.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He has a nice face.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:21.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He looks a lot like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:24.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:27.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not very much like him at all, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:31.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My father's fighting in the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:36.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My father went away to war too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:40.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But that was a long, long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:44.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Before this dreadful winter.  - Winter's not all bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:49.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's ice skating and snowball fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.11,0:19:53.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh! And Christmas!  - Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:58.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. No, we haven't had a Christmas in a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:20:01.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What? No presents for a hundred years?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:04.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Always winter, never Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:07.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's been a long winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.09,0:20:11.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you would have loved Narnia in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:15.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We fauns danced with the dryads all night,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:19.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and, you know, we never got tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:25.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And music. Oh, such music!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:29.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Would... would you like to hear some now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:33.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh! Yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.02,0:20:40.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, are you familiar
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:44.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- with any Narnian lullabies?  - Sorry, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:46.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:51.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Because this... probably won't sound anything like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, I should go.  - It's too late for that now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:23.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm such a terrible faun.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:29.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:32.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're the nicest faun I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.14,0:22:35.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then I'm afraid you've had a very poor sampling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.81,0:22:40.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. You can't have done anything that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.28,0:22:46.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not something I have done, Lucy Pevensie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.12,0:22:49.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's something I am doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:51.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:55.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm kidnapping you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.53,0:22:57.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was the White Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.33,0:22:59.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's the one who makes it always winter, always cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.93,0:23:01.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She gave orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.57,0:23:04.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If any of us ever find a human wandering in the woods,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.97,0:23:07.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we're supposed to turn it over to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:11.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But, Mr. Tumnus, you wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:19.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you were my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:26.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now. She may already know you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:29.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The woods are full of her spies.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.83,0:23:34.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Even some of the trees are on her side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:41.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you find your way back from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:44.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I think so.  - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.91,0:23:51.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.45,0:23:55.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.75,0:23:59.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.03,0:24:03.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:09.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep it. You need it more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:15.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, Lucy Pevensie,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:17.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am glad to have met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.77,0:24:20.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You've made me feel warmer than I've felt in a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.58,0:24:24.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.18,0:24:25.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.56,0:24:38.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...99, 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:40.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready or not, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.13,0:24:43.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right! I'm back! I'm all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.47,0:24:45.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up! He's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.61,0:24:53.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm not sure you two have quite got the idea of this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.11,0:24:55.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Weren't you wondering where I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.71,0:24:58.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the point. That was why he was seeking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.98,0:25:00.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Does this mean I win?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.42,0:25:02.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think Lucy wants to play anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.65,0:25:05.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been gone for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.50,0:25:22.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy, the only wood in here is the back of the wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.61,0:25:26.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,One game at a time, Lu. We don't all have your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.71,0:25:33.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't imagining!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:35.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.72,0:25:38.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't lie about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:39.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:43.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You do?  - Yeah, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:45.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you about the field in the cupboards?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:48.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you just stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.23,0:25:50.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You just have to make everything worse, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.93,0:25:53.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It was just a joke!  - When are you gonna learn to grow up?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.94,0:25:57.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You think you're Dad, but you're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.78,0:26:03.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, that was nicely handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.18,0:26:09.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But... it really was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.55,0:26:12.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan's right, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.69,0:26:14.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.39,0:27:52.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.06,0:27:55.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.53,0:27:59.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Boo!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.90,0:28:07.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.74,0:28:12.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hope you're not afraid of the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.18,0:28:19.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.46,0:28:27.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.79,0:28:30.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.88,0:28:50.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.71,0:28:53.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.29,0:28:57.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.12,0:29:00.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I believe you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.38,0:29:28.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.93,0:29:46.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.81,0:29:54.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.63,0:30:18.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Leave me alone!  - What is it now, Ginarrbrik?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.30,0:30:20.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Make him let me go! I didn't do anything wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.64,0:30:23.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How dare you address the Queen of Narnia?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.11,0:30:24.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.04,0:30:28.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You will know her better hereafter!  - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.66,0:30:41.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is your name, Son of Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.82,0:30:44.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh, Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.16,0:30:48.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And how, Edmund, did you come to enter my dominion?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.33,0:30:52.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. I was just following my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.40,0:30:56.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Your sister? How many are you?  - Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.14,0:30:58.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy's the only one that's been here before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.98,0:31:02.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She said she met some faun called Tumnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.98,0:31:06.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter and Susan didn't believe her. I didn't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.12,0:31:10.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund, you look so cold. Will you come and sit with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.74,0:31:29.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, how about something hot to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.91,0:31:34.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, please, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.56,0:31:54.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your drink, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.43,0:31:56.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.63,0:31:58.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can make anything you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.64,0:32:02.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you make me taller?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.24,0:32:05.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Anything you'd like to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.71,0:32:08.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Turkish delight?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.44,0:32:36.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.27,0:32:39.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I would very much like to meet the rest of your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.61,0:32:41.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.15,0:32:44.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're nothing special.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:50.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sure they're not nearly as delightful as you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.12,0:32:56.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you see, Edmund, I have no children of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.26,0:32:58.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you are exactly the sort of boy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.29,0:33:03.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,who I could see, one day, becoming Prince of Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.97,0:33:06.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe even King.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.37,0:33:09.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.07,0:33:12.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course, you'd have to bring your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.68,0:33:13.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.04,0:33:17.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you mean, Peter would be king too?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:20.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.92,0:33:23.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But a king needs servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.22,0:33:27.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I guess I could bring 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.03,0:33:35.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Beyond these woods, you see those two hills?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.23,0:33:38.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My house is right between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.47,0:33:40.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd love it there, Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.50,0:33:44.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It has whole rooms simply stuffed with Turkish delight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.91,0:33:48.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Couldn't I have some more now?  - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.78,0:33:53.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't want to ruin your appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.18,0:33:56.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides, you and I are going to be seeing each other again very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.92,0:34:00.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope so, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.92,0:34:05.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Until then, dear one. Mmm, I'm gonna miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.13,0:34:10.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yah! Yah! Yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.01,0:34:19.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.94,0:34:23.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, Edmund! You got in too!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.81,0:34:26.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't it wonderful?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.55,0:34:30.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where have you been?  - With Mr. Tumnus. He's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.85,0:34:34.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The White Witch hasn't found out anything about him meeting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.79,0:34:36.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The White Witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:40.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She calls herself the Queen of Narnia, but she really isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.53,0:34:45.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you all right? You look awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.77,0:34:49.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, what'd you expect? I mean, it's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.77,0:34:53.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- How do we get out of here?  - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.51,0:34:55.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.31,0:34:59.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter, Peter, wake up! Peter, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.88,0:35:01.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's there! It's really there!  - Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.85,0:35:04.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lucy, what are you talking about?  - Narnia!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.79,0:35:07.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all in the wardrobe like I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.22,0:35:10.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You've just been dreaming, Lucy.  - But I haven't!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.39,0:35:14.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I saw Mr. Tumnus again! And this time Edmund went too.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.57,0:35:20.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You... You saw the faun?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.91,0:35:27.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, he didn't actually go there with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.01,0:35:30.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.68,0:35:35.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What were you doing, Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.25,0:35:40.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was just playing along.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.59,0:35:43.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Peter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.16,0:35:45.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have encouraged her,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.66,0:35:48.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but you know what little children are like these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.66,0:35:52.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They just don't know when to stop pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.11,0:36:00.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.64,0:36:04.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.12,0:36:13.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You children are one shenanigan shy of sleepin' in the stable!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.86,0:36:20.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Professor. I'm sorry. I told them you were not to be disturbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.90,0:36:24.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Mrs. Macready. I'm sure there's an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.50,0:36:28.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But first of all, I think this one is in need of a little hot chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.87,0:36:32.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come along, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.35,0:36:43.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You seem to have upset the delicate internal balance of my housekeeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.02,0:36:46.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're very sorry, sir. It won't happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.92,0:36:49.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's our sister, sir. Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.39,0:36:52.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- The weeping girl.  - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.56,0:36:55.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- She's upset.  - Hence the weeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.60,0:36:57.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.10,0:37:00.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We can handle it.  - Oh, I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.87,0:37:04.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She thinks she's found a magical land.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.67,0:37:07.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In the upstairs wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.51,0:37:11.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.31,0:37:15.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Um, the wardrobe, upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.69,0:37:18.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy thinks she's found a forest inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.22,0:37:20.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She won't stop going on about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.32,0:37:24.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was it like?  - Like talking to a lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.96,0:37:27.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, not her. The forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.53,0:37:30.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're not saying you believe her?  - You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.07,0:37:32.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.60,0:37:35.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, logically, it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.20,0:37:38.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do they teach in schools these days?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.14,0:37:40.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund said they were only pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.14,0:37:42.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's usually the more truthful one, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.28,0:37:46.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. This would be the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.25,0:37:48.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, if she's not mad and she's not lying,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.42,0:37:52.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,then logically we must assume she's telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.39,0:37:56.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're saying that we should just believe her?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.13,0:38:02.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's your sister, isn't she? You're her family.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.37,0:38:07.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You might just try acting like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.74,0:38:11.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter winds up, poised to take yet another wicket!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.84,0:38:13.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.58,0:38:17.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoops! Wake up, Dolly Daydream.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.25,0:38:20.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why can't we play hide and seek again?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.48,0:38:23.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you said it was a kid's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.19,0:38:27.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Besides, we could all use the fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.66,0:38:30.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not like there isn't air inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.59,0:38:35.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you ready?  - Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.31,0:38:53.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well done, Ed.  - You bowled it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.82,0:38:56.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What on earth is goin' on?  - The Macready!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.82,0:38:58.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.96,0:39:07.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no, back, back, back!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.39,0:39:38.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Come on!  - Oh, you've got to be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.51,0:39:51.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.71,0:39:54.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- My toe!  - I'm not on your toe!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.74,0:39:57.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Move back.  - Will you stop shoving?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.29,0:40:12.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,lmpossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.70,0:40:16.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.23,0:40:19.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's just your imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.80,0:40:22.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't suppose saying we're sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.04,0:40:26.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- would quite cover it.  - No. It wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.11,0:40:31.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- But that might!  - Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.02,0:40:36.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.99,0:40:40.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.32,0:40:43.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.43,0:40:46.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You little liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.33,0:40:50.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You didn't believe her, either.  - Apologize to Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.90,0:40:55.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Say you're sorry.  - All right! I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.70,0:40:57.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.74,0:41:00.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Some children just don't know when to stop pretending.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.81,0:41:02.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.34,0:41:04.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe we should go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.28,0:41:07.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But shouldn't we at least take a look around?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.85,0:41:09.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think Lucy should decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.15,0:41:14.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like you all to meet Mr. Tumnus!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.42,0:41:16.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, then Mr. Tumnus it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.69,0:41:21.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But we can't go hiking in the snow dressed like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.13,0:41:22.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.00,0:41:27.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure the professor wouldn't mind us using these.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.77,0:41:32.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyway, if you think about it logically,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.17,0:41:34.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we're not even taking them out of the wardrobe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.64,0:41:37.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- But that's a girl's coat!  - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.99,0:42:26.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...Iots and lots of lovely food, and we'll have lots and lots of...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.20,0:42:30.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lu?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.57,0:42:33.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.45,0:42:54.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who would do something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.84,0:43:15.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"The Faun Tumnus is hereby charged
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.38,0:43:19.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,with High Treason against Her lmperial Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.55,0:43:22.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jadis, Queen of Narnia,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.58,0:43:25.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,for comforting her enemies and fraternizing with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.95,0:43:29.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Signed Maugrim, Captain of the Secret Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.49,0:43:31.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Long Live the Queen."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.90,0:43:36.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Now we really should go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.20,0:43:37.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But what about Mr. Tumnus?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.93,0:43:40.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If he was arrested just for being with a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.87,0:43:44.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I don't think there's much we can do.  - You don't understand, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.97,0:43:48.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the human.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.18,0:43:50.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She must have found out he helped me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.68,0:43:54.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Maybe we could call the police.  - These are the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.32,0:43:56.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Lu. We'll think of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.62,0:43:58.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.12,0:44:00.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean, he's a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.22,0:44:03.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Psst.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.79,0:44:09.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did that bird just "psst" us?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:54.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It... It's a beaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.72,0:45:02.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.82,0:45:04.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.66,0:45:12.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't gonna smell it, if that's what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.09,0:45:13.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.50,0:45:14.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.20,0:45:17.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy Pevensie?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.44,0:45:24.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.38,0:45:35.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's the hankie I gave to Mr. Tum...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.68,0:45:38.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tumnus. He got it to me just before they took him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.85,0:45:40.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.09,0:45:43.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Further in.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.96,0:45:47.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What are you doing?  - She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.93,0:45:50.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How do we know we can trust him?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.60,0:45:52.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He said he knows the faun.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.40,0:45:56.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's a beaver. He shouldn't be saying anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.47,0:45:58.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.27,0:46:00.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. We were just talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.64,0:46:03.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's better left for safer quarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.78,0:46:06.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He means the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.60,0:46:25.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. We don't want to be caught out here after nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.38,0:46:42.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah, blimey! Looks like the old girl has got the kettle on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.58,0:46:44.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice cup o' Rosy Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.35,0:46:47.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's lovely.  - It's merely a trifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.12,0:46:49.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Still plenty to do. Ain't quite finished it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.52,0:46:51.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It'll look the business when it is, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.03,0:46:56.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Beaver, is that you? I've been worried sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.43,0:46:59.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If I find you've been out with Badger again, l...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.04,0:47:01.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.37,0:47:03.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, those aren't badgers.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.74,0:47:08.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I never thought I'd live to see this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.28,0:47:12.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at my fur. You couldn't give me ten minutes warning?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.78,0:47:15.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd have given a week if I thought it would've helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.42,0:47:17.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, come inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.49,0:47:19.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and we'll see if we can't get you some food,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.76,0:47:24.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and some civilized company.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.26,0:47:26.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, careful. Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.63,0:47:28.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse the mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.30,0:47:31.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't get Mr. Beaver to get out of his chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.57,0:47:38.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Enjoyin' the scenery, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.94,0:47:44.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything we can do to help Tumnus?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.75,0:47:47.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll have taken him to the Witch's. You know what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.92,0:47:51.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's few that go through them gates that come out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.85,0:47:54.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fish 'n' chips?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.96,0:47:58.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But there is hope, dear. Lots of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.66,0:48:02.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, there's a right bit more than hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.00,0:48:05.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan is on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.91,0:48:14.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's Aslan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.24,0:48:17.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's Aslan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.21,0:48:20.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You cheeky little blighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.92,0:48:23.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.75,0:48:29.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You don't know, do you?  - We haven't exactly been here long.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.29,0:48:31.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, he's only the king of the whole wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.76,0:48:35.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The top geezer. The real King of Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.40,0:48:39.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's been away for a long while.  - But he's just got back!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.40,0:48:42.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And he's waitin' for you near the Stone Table!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.27,0:48:45.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's waiting for us?  - You're bloomin' joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.41,0:48:48.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They don't even know about the prophecy!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.08,0:48:51.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Well, then...  - Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.98,0:48:54.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan's return,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.25,0:48:57.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tumnus' arrest, the secret police,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.62,0:48:59.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,it's all happening because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.82,0:49:03.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're blaming us?  - No! Not blaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.29,0:49:07.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Thanking you.  - There's a prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.23,0:49:10.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"When Adam's flesh and Adam's bone
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.20,0:49:13.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,sits at Cair Paravel in throne,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.34,0:49:16.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the evil time will be over and done."
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:18.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- That doesn't really rhyme.  - I know it don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.47,0:49:20.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're kinda missin' the point!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.84,0:49:23.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It has long been foretold
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.35,0:49:26.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,that two Sons of Adam and two Daughters of Eve
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.15,0:49:31.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,will defeat the White Witch and restore peace to Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.79,0:49:35.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you think we're the ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.39,0:49:38.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd better be, 'cause Aslan's already fitted out your army.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.49,0:49:40.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Our army?  - Mum sent us away
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.53,0:49:43.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,so we wouldn't get caught up in a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.17,0:49:46.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you've made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.04,0:49:49.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're not heroes.  - We're from Finchley.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.97,0:49:52.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.17,0:49:55.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your hospitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.24,0:49:59.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- But we really have to go.  - No, you can't just leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.95,0:50:03.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's right. We have to help Mr. Tumnus.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.62,0:50:06.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's out of our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.22,0:50:07.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.72,0:50:10.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but it's time the four of us were getting home. Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:15.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ed?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.23,0:50:20.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm gonna kill him.  - You may not have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.67,0:50:23.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Has Edmund ever been to Narnia before?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.47,0:50:51.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.15,0:51:14.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Edmund!  - Shh! They'll hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.96,0:51:17.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.19,0:51:19.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Get off!  - You're playing into her hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.69,0:51:22.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We can't just let him go!  - He's our brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:25.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's the bait! The Witch wants all four of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.33,0:51:29.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Why?  - To stop the prophecy from coming true.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.30,0:51:30.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.68,0:51:43.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- This is all your fault.  - My fault?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.02,0:51:47.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,None of this would have happened if you had listened to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.16,0:51:49.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You knew this would happen.  - I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.46,0:51:52.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Which is why we should have left while we could!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.16,0:51:53.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.33,0:51:58.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- This isn't going to help Edmund.  - She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.17,0:52:01.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Only Aslan can help your brother now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.00,0:52:04.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then take us to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.74,0:53:17.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be still, stranger, or you'll never move again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.31,0:53:19.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?  - I'm Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.05,0:53:23.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I met the Queen in the woods! She told me to come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.75,0:53:25.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a Son of Adam!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.29,0:53:30.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hmm. My apologies, fortunate favorite of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.39,0:53:33.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or else, not so fortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.00,0:53:39.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Right this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.96,0:54:02.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.03,0:54:43.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.26,0:54:48.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Uh... Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.64,0:54:52.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you might.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.81,0:54:56.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Edmund...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.28,0:55:01.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are your sisters deaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.42,0:55:03.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.18,0:55:06.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And your brother, is he...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.92,0:55:09.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...unintelligent?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.99,0:55:12.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I think so. But Mum says...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.50,0:55:16.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then how dare you come alone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.70,0:55:19.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I tried!  - Edmund, I asked so little of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.50,0:55:22.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- They just don't listen to me!  - You couldn't even do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.47,0:55:23.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I did bring them halfway.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.04,0:55:26.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're at the little house at the dam with the Beavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.92,0:55:35.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.92,0:55:39.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I suppose you're not a total loss then, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.59,0:55:44.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I was wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.50,0:55:50.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,could I maybe have some more Turkish delight now?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.07,0:55:58.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Our guest is hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.82,0:56:08.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This way for your num-nums.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.42,0:56:13.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maugrim?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.33,0:56:17.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.62,0:56:43.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Mother! They're after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.69,0:56:46.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Mother! They're after us!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.26,0:56:49.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Oh, right then.  - What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.93,0:56:51.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, you'll be thanking me later.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.73,0:56:53.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a long journey and Beaver gets pretty cranky when he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.33,0:56:55.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a long journey and Beaver gets pretty cranky when he's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.20,0:56:56.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm cranky now!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.94,0:57:00.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.74,0:57:05.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you think we'll need jam?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.53,0:57:07.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Only if the Witch serves toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.46,0:57:23.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.94,0:57:42.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Badger and me dug this. Comes out right near his place.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.35,0:57:44.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You told me it led to your mum's!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.28,0:57:46.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.28,0:57:49.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They're in the tunnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.85,0:57:52.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Quick! This way.  - Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.09,0:57:56.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Run!  - Quick! Quick! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.60,0:58:06.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You should have brought a map!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.64,0:58:09.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There wasn't room next to the jam.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.21,0:58:18.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.03,0:58:41.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.44,0:58:43.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He was my best mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.95,0:58:54.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.28,0:58:57.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is what becomes of those who cross the Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.19,0:59:00.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You take one more step, traitor, and I'll chew you to splinters!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.02,0:59:03.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Relax. I'm one of the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.96,0:59:08.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah? Well, you look an awful lot like one of the bad ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.10,0:59:10.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,An unfortunate family resemblance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.50,0:59:13.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But we can argue breeding later. Right now we've got to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.21,0:59:17.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you have in mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.78,0:59:26.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Greetings, gents.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.22,0:59:30.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lost something, have we?  - Don't patronize me!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.65,0:59:33.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know where your allegiance lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.42,0:59:36.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're looking for some humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.69,0:59:39.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Humans? Here in Narnia?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.10,0:59:41.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a valuable bit of information, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.80,0:59:46.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your reward is your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.20,0:59:48.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not much,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.44,0:59:50.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but still.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.54,0:59:53.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are the fugitives?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.55,1:00:03.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,North. They ran north.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.45,1:00:06.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Smell them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.73,1:00:20.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They were helping Tumnus. The Witch got here before I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.74,1:00:23.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.44,1:00:24.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.94,1:00:28.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, I wish I could say their bark was worse than their bite. Ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.18,1:00:32.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop squirming! You're worse than Beaver on bath day.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.68,1:00:34.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Worst day of the year.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.25,1:00:36.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your kindness,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.85,1:00:38.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but that's all the cure I have time for.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.06,1:00:40.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're leaving?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.12,1:00:43.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It has been a pleasure, My Queen, and an honor, but time is short
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.79,1:00:46.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and Aslan himself has asked me to gather more troops.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.03,1:00:50.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You've seen Aslan?  - What's he like?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.93,1:00:54.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Like everything we've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.10,1:00:57.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll be glad to have him by your side in the battle against the Witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.71,1:01:00.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But we're not planning on fighting any witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.58,1:01:03.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But surely, King Peter, the prophecy!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.45,1:01:05.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't go to war without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.12,1:01:13.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We just want our brother back.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.25,1:01:39.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.35,1:01:44.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you're not going to eat that...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.76,1:01:52.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd get up, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.90,1:01:55.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...but my legs.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.21,1:02:07.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tumnus.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.05,1:02:11.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's left of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.49,1:02:21.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- You're Lucy Pevensie's brother.  - I'm Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.49,1:02:25.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. Yes, you have the same nose.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.23,1:02:32.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is your sister all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.57,1:02:36.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is she safe?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.01,1:02:42.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.19,1:02:52.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My police tore that dam apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.62,1:02:57.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your little family are nowhere to be found.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.26,1:03:04.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Where did they go?  - I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.90,1:03:07.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you're of no further use to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.60,1:03:11.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! The beaver said something about Aslan!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.38,1:03:17.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.22,1:03:20.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.89,1:03:25.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- l...  - He's a stranger here, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.72,1:03:27.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He can't be expected to know anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.63,1:03:33.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I said... where is Aslan?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.87,1:03:40.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.10,1:03:42.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I left before they said anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.97,1:03:47.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted to see you!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.65,1:03:51.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Guard!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.05,1:03:53.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.05,1:03:58.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Release the faun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.66,1:04:02.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.43,1:04:13.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you know why you're here, faun?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.07,1:04:20.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I believe in a free Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.04,1:04:23.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're here...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.41,1:04:26.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...because he turned you in.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.68,1:04:30.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For sweeties.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.03,1:04:39.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take him upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.60,1:04:48.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And ready my sleigh.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.34,1:04:51.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund misses his family.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.43,1:05:16.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, Aslan's camp is near the Stone Table
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.00,1:05:20.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- just across the frozen river.  - River?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.64,1:05:24.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The river's been frozen solid for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.74,1:05:31.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's so far.  - It's the world, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.25,1:05:33.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you expect it to be small?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.05,1:05:36.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Smaller.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.10,1:05:56.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When you're ready, Son of Adam.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.75,1:06:06.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yah! Yah! Yah!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.41,1:06:35.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, humans! While we're still young.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.91,1:06:38.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If he tells us to hurry one more time,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.78,1:06:42.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna turn him into a big, fluffy hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.65,1:06:44.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.05,1:06:48.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- He is getting a little bossy.  - Behind you! It's her!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.86,1:06:50.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Run! Run!  - Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.95,1:07:17.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.06,1:07:21.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,lnside!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.79,1:07:23.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dive! Dive!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.13,1:07:28.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Quick! Quick, quick, quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.56,1:07:59.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.93,1:08:02.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I suppose I'll go look.  - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.50,1:08:05.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're worth nothing to Narnia dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.17,1:08:07.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, neither are you, Beaver.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.24,1:08:09.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.81,1:08:21.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's that? What's...  - Shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.42,1:08:26.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come out! Come out!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.26,1:08:29.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope you've all been good 'cause there's someone here to see you!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.28,1:08:53.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.25,1:08:57.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It certainly is, Lucy, since you have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.35,1:09:01.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, I've put up with a lot since I got here, but this...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.49,1:09:04.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We thought you were the Witch.  - Yes, yes, I'm sorry about that,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.03,1:09:10.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but in my defense, I have been driving one of these longer than the Witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.60,1:09:13.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought there was no Christmas in Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.80,1:09:16.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. For a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.44,1:09:20.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But the hope that you have brought, Your Majesties,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.84,1:09:24.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,is finally starting to weaken the Witch's power.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.78,1:09:29.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Still, I dare say you could do with these.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.72,1:09:33.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Presents!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.36,1:09:42.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The juice of the fire-flower.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.77,1:09:46.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,One drop will cure any injury.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.44,1:09:51.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And though I hope you never have to use it...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.11,1:09:56.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.08,1:09:59.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but I think I could be brave enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.58,1:10:02.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you could.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.35,1:10:05.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But battles are ugly affairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.43,1:10:14.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.67,1:10:21.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Trust in this bow and it will not easily miss.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.64,1:10:25.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened to "battles are ugly affairs"?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.51,1:10:30.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Though you don't seem to have a problem making yourself heard,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.78,1:10:34.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,blow on this and wherever you are,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.72,1:10:36.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,help will come.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.02,1:10:39.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.69,1:10:42.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.73,1:10:47.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The time to use these may be near at hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.27,1:10:56.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.24,1:11:01.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,These are tools, not toys.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.14,1:11:03.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bear them well and wisely.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.08,1:11:07.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, I must be off.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.85,1:11:10.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Winter is almost over,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.49,1:11:14.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and things do pile up when you've been gone a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.29,1:11:20.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Long live Aslan!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.87,1:11:24.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.34,1:11:29.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Merry Christmas!  - Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.01,1:11:33.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- See you next year!  - Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.41,1:11:35.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Told you he was real.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.85,1:11:40.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He said winter was almost over.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.72,1:11:42.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what that means.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.39,1:11:46.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No more ice.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.87,1:12:00.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We need to cross, now!  - Don't beavers make dams?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.24,1:12:02.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm not that fast, dear.  - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.54,1:12:04.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! Will you think about this for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.87,1:12:07.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We don't have a minute.  - I'm just trying to be realistic.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.74,1:12:11.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, you're trying to be smart. As usual.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.75,1:12:48.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait. Maybe I should go first.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.85,1:12:51.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.03,1:13:00.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You've been sneaking second helpings, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.06,1:13:02.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, you never know which meal's gonna be your last.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.70,1:13:06.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Especially with your cooking.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.52,1:13:26.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If Mum knew what we were doing...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.56,1:13:27.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mum's not here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.96,1:13:32.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.19,1:13:33.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.00,1:13:38.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.68,1:13:50.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.25,1:13:51.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.15,1:13:54.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put that down, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.68,1:13:57.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Someone could get hurt.  - Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.02,1:13:59.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Run him through!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.46,1:14:03.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave now while you can, and your brother leaves with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.23,1:14:06.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop, Peter! Maybe we should listen to him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.26,1:14:07.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Smart girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.00,1:14:11.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him! Kill him! Kill him now!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.33,1:14:14.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. This isn't your war.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.70,1:14:18.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All my Queen wants is for you to take your family and go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.27,1:14:21.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, just because some man in a red coat hands you a sword,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.14,1:14:24.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,it doesn't make you a hero! Just drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.78,1:14:27.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, Peter! Narnia needs you!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.45,1:14:29.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Gut him while you still have a chance!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.82,1:14:33.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's it gonna be, Son of Adam? I won't wait forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.99,1:14:35.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And neither will the river.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.63,1:14:38.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.64,1:14:48.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold onto me!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.96,1:15:50.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.81,1:16:00.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.28,1:16:05.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.82,1:16:08.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.92,1:16:15.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Has anyone seen my coat?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.70,1:16:23.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't you worry, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.70,1:16:26.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your brother's got you well looked after.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.04,1:16:30.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And I don't think you'll be needing those coats anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.71,1:17:09.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so warm out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.35,1:17:15.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll go and check the sleigh.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.05,1:17:18.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.75,1:17:20.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We found the traitor.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.56,1:17:22.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He was rallying your enemies near the Shuddering Woods.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.06,1:17:26.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah. Nice of you to drop in.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.40,1:17:28.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You were so helpful to my wolves last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.30,1:17:31.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you can help me now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.90,1:17:35.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Forgive me, Your Majesty.  - Oh, don't waste time with flattery.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.84,1:17:40.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not to seem rude, but I wasn't actually talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.95,1:17:51.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are the humans headed?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.39,1:17:59.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! No! Don't. The beaver said something about the Stone Table,
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.93,1:18:01.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and that Aslan had an army there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.63,1:18:05.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,An army?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.91,1:18:13.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.08,1:18:16.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm glad this creature got to see some honesty...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.88,1:18:20.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- ...before he dies.  - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.36,1:18:34.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think about whose side you're on, Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.66,1:18:36.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mine...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.80,1:18:40.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...or theirs.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.14,1:18:49.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on ahead. Gather the faithful.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.95,1:18:52.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If it's a war Aslan wants...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.65,1:18:56.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...it's a war he shall get.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.15,1:20:00.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are they all staring at us?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.88,1:20:03.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe they think you look funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.92,1:20:12.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oi, stop your fussing. You look lovely.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.05,1:20:32.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have come to see Aslan.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.29,1:21:19.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Peter, Son of Adam.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.83,1:21:23.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Susan and Lucy, Daughters of Eve.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.80,1:21:27.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And welcome to you, Beavers. You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.47,1:21:30.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But where is the fourth?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.11,1:21:34.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why we're here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.14,1:21:35.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.68,1:21:38.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We had a little trouble along the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.88,1:21:41.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Our brother's been captured by the White Witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.28,1:21:44.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Captured? How could this happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.69,1:21:50.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He betrayed them, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.19,1:21:53.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Then he has betrayed us all!  - Peace, Oreius.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.06,1:21:56.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure there's an explanation.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.00,1:22:01.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's my fault, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.60,1:22:05.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was too hard on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.74,1:22:10.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We all were.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.08,1:22:12.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, he's our brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.98,1:22:14.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know, dear one.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.05,1:22:18.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But that only makes the betrayal all the worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.89,1:22:21.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This may be harder than you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.83,1:22:33.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That is Cair Paravel, the castle of the four thrones.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.70,1:22:39.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In one of which you will sit, Peter, as High King.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.67,1:22:42.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You doubt the prophecy?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.18,1:22:45.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. That's just it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.08,1:22:50.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan, I'm not what you all think I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.12,1:22:52.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter Pevensie, formerly of Finchley.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.72,1:22:58.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Beaver also mentioned that you planned on turning him into a hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.26,1:23:04.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter, there is a Deep Magic,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.87,1:23:06.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,more powerful than any of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.60,1:23:08.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,that rules over all of Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.90,1:23:11.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It defines right from wrong,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.54,1:23:14.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and governs all our destinies.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.31,1:23:17.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yours... and mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.75,1:23:19.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But I couldn't even protect my own family.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.98,1:23:22.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You've brought them safely this far.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.82,1:23:24.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.75,1:23:29.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter, I will do what I can to help your brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.16,1:23:32.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but I need you to consider what I ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.22,1:23:36.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I, too, want my family safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.80,1:23:43.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is our little prince uncomfortable?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.93,1:23:47.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Does he want his pillow fluffed?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.17,1:23:53.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Special treatment for the special boy!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.91,1:23:57.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Isn't that what you wanted?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.25,1:24:01.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You look like Mum.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.02,1:24:04.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mum hasn't had a dress like this since before the war.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.36,1:24:10.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We should bring her one back. A whole trunk full!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.49,1:24:13.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If we ever get back.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.40,1:24:19.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.10,1:24:24.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We used to have fun together, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.64,1:24:28.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. Before you got boring.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.04,1:24:30.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.06,1:24:45.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please don't try to run.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.56,1:24:49.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're tired.  - And we prefer to kill you quickly.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.30,1:24:55.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.28,1:25:06.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.65,1:25:09.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.32,1:25:12.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.69,1:25:16.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We've already been through this before.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.73,1:25:19.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We both know you haven't got it in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.36,1:25:21.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.17,1:25:34.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Stay your weapons. This is Peter's battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.38,1:25:38.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You may think you're a king,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.58,1:25:40.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but you're going to die...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.95,1:25:43.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- ...Iike a dog!  - Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.92,1:25:45.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.24,1:26:04.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,After him.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.54,1:26:07.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He'll lead you to Edmund.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.91,1:26:13.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.18,1:26:15.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Clean your sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.39,1:26:25.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Rise, Sir Peter Wolf's-Bane,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.13,1:26:27.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Knight of Narnia.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.99,1:26:55.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The minotaurs will take the left flanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.76,1:26:58.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll keep the giants in reserve and send the dwarfs in first.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.00,1:27:09.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The prisoner!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.57,1:27:40.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.81,1:27:45.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.18,1:27:51.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.31,1:28:24.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.18,1:28:58.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.51,1:29:02.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There is no need to speak to Edmund about what is past.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.46,1:29:13.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.11,1:29:30.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you all right?  - I'm a little tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.31,1:29:32.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.59,1:29:42.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And Edmund...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.86,1:29:46.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...try not to wander off.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.88,1:30:02.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Narnia's not going to run out of toast, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.05,1:30:07.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure they'll pack something up for the journey back.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.48,1:30:08.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're going home?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.79,1:30:11.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You are.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.62,1:30:15.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I promised Mum I'd keep you three safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.99,1:30:18.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't mean I can't stay behind and help.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.56,1:30:20.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But they need us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.10,1:30:24.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All four of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.40,1:30:26.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucy, it's too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.37,1:30:28.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You almost drowned! Edmund was almost killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.67,1:30:32.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Which is why we have to stay.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.24,1:30:39.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've seen what the White Witch can do. And I've helped her do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.42,1:30:44.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And we can't leave these people behind to suffer for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.39,1:30:53.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I suppose that's it then.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.26,1:30:56.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.63,1:31:01.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To get in some practice.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.09,1:31:27.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ed! Sword point up, like Oreius showed us.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.23,1:31:29.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- En garde!  - Now block.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.80,1:31:34.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey!  - Peter! Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.44,1:31:37.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whoa, horsie!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.31,1:31:39.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- My name is Philip.  - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.91,1:31:41.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.78,1:31:44.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Witch has demanded a meeting with Aslan.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.71,1:31:48.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's on her way here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.12,1:31:50.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jadis, the Queen of Narnia!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.25,1:31:51.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jadis, the Queen of Narnia!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.92,1:31:56.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Go away, Witch!  - Empress of the Lone lslands!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.89,1:31:59.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't belong here! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.69,1:32:26.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have a traitor in your midst, Aslan.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.66,1:32:32.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His offense was not against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.10,1:32:36.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you forgotten the laws upon which Narnia was built?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.43,1:32:39.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not cite the Deep Magic to me, Witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.00,1:32:43.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was there when it was written.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.91,1:32:49.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you'll remember well that every traitor belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.54,1:32:52.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His blood is my property.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.51,1:32:54.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Try and take him then.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.55,1:33:02.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you really think that mere force will deny me my right...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.89,1:33:04.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...Iittle King?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.20,1:33:10.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan knows that unless I have blood, as the law demands,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.03,1:33:14.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,all of Narnia will be overturned
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.54,1:33:17.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and perish in fire and water.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.61,1:33:20.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That boy will die
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.91,1:33:24.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,on the Stone Table...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.41,1:33:28.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...as is tradition.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.95,1:33:33.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You dare not refuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.92,1:33:35.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.39,1:33:40.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I shall talk with you alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.98,1:34:36.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She has renounced her claim on the Son of Adam's blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.89,1:34:41.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How do I know your promise will be kept?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.71,1:35:37.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Susan!  - Mm?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.58,1:36:30.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you both be in bed?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.92,1:36:35.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.32,1:36:38.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, Aslan.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.16,1:36:40.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Couldn't we come with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.93,1:36:44.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I would be glad of the company for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.73,1:36:47.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.53,1:37:13.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is time.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.33,1:37:16.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,From here, I must go on alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.83,1:37:18.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But Aslan...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.33,1:37:21.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have to trust me. For this must be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.44,1:37:24.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Susan.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.27,1:37:26.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Lucy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.77,1:37:28.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.41,1:38:38.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Behold. The great lion.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.10,1:39:05.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you want some milk?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.37,1:39:08.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why doesn't he fight back?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.68,1:39:12.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bind him!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.41,1:39:16.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tie him up! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.65,1:39:22.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.82,1:39:26.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let him first be shaved.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.82,1:39:50.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring him to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.48,1:40:54.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know, Aslan,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.28,1:40:56.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a little disappointed in you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.42,1:41:02.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you honestly think by all this that you could save the human traitor?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.66,1:41:08.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You are giving me your life
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.60,1:41:10.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and saving no one.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.47,1:41:15.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So much for love.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.28,1:41:26.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tonight...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.15,1:41:31.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...the Deep Magic will be appeased!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.29,1:41:37.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.39,1:41:43.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we will take Narnia
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.50,1:41:47.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,forever!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.71,1:41:54.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In that knowledge,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.94,1:41:57.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,despair...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.69,1:42:09.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...and die!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.01,1:42:29.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Great Cat...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.01,1:42:32.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...is dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.07,1:42:38.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.20,1:42:41.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Prepare your troops for battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.24,1:42:46.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,However short it may be.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.33,1:43:36.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.06,1:43:39.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.25,1:44:01.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He must have known what he was doing.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.12,1:44:38.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get away! Get away, all of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.79,1:44:41.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.68,1:45:05.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to tell the others.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.85,1:45:09.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- We can't just leave him!  - Lucy, there's no time.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.59,1:45:11.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They need to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.10,1:45:20.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The trees.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.34,1:46:06.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be still, my Princes.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.11,1:46:11.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I bring grave news from your sisters.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.43,1:46:28.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.44,1:46:33.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.74,1:46:40.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you'll have to lead us.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.02,1:46:48.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter, there's an army out there and it's ready to follow you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.39,1:46:51.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't.  - Aslan believed you could.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.89,1:46:56.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And so do l.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.54,1:47:08.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Witch's army is nearing, sire. What are your orders?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.09,1:47:57.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They come, Your Highness, in numbers and weapons far greater than our own.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.79,1:47:59.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Numbers do not win a battle.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.03,1:48:03.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. But I bet they help.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.89,1:49:36.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.49,1:49:38.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.67,1:50:29.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.55,1:50:38.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look to the sky!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.18,1:51:07.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.31,1:51:09.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To the death.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.82,1:51:17.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For Narnia and for Aslan!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.53,1:51:23.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.86,1:51:26.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go! For Aslan!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.76,1:53:00.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We should go.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.26,1:53:08.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm so cold.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.85,1:53:30.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.33,1:53:36.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.31,1:53:54.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Aslan?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.81,1:53:57.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What have they done?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.83,1:54:09.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Aslan!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.60,1:54:20.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But we saw the knife. The Witch.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.07,1:54:23.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If the Witch knew the true meaning of sacrifice,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.68,1:54:27.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,she might have interpreted the Deep Magic differently.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.08,1:54:29.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That when a willing victim who has committed no treachery
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.78,1:54:32.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,is killed in a traitor's stead,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.08,1:54:35.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the Stone Table will crack
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.42,1:54:39.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and even death itself will turn backwards.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.16,1:54:41.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We sent the news that you were dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.76,1:54:43.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter and Edmund will have gone to war.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.03,1:54:45.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to help them.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.50,1:54:49.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We will, dear one, but not alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.70,1:54:51.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Climb on my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.47,1:54:54.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have far to go and little time to get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.27,1:54:57.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you may want to cover your ears.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.90,1:55:19.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.55,1:55:41.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.63,1:55:56.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fall back! Draw them to the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.63,1:56:00.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the signal. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.28,1:56:09.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.96,1:56:21.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.79,1:56:24.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fall back!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.20,1:56:27.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on, fall back!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.34,1:57:05.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.17,1:59:20.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Susan, this is...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.10,1:59:22.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Tumnus!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.21,1:59:26.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come, we must hurry and search the castle.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.54,1:59:29.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter will need everyone we can find.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.05,1:59:36.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.94,1:59:58.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund! There's too many!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.61,2:00:00.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.24,2:00:03.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the girls and get them home!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.65,2:00:08.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You heard him! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.74,2:00:29.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter said get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.44,2:00:31.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter's not king yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.54,2:02:09.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.38,2:03:25.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is finished.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.22,2:03:29.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Peter!  - Peter!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.19,2:03:37.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's Edmund?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.87,2:03:50.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.74,2:03:51.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.33,2:04:45.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When are you gonna learn to do as you're told?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.19,2:06:24.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To the glistening Eastern Sea,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.23,2:06:28.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I give you Queen Lucy the Valiant.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.49,2:06:55.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To the great Western Wood,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.99,2:07:00.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,King Edmund the Just.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.43,2:07:04.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To the radiant Southern Sun,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.74,2:07:09.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Queen Susan, the Gentle.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.27,2:07:13.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And to the clear Northern Sky,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.54,2:07:17.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I give you King Peter,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.31,2:07:19.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the Magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.09,2:07:26.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Once a King or Queen of Narnia,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.12,2:07:29.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,always a King or Queen.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.43,2:07:31.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,May your wisdom grace us
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.26,2:07:34.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,until the stars rain down from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.47,2:07:36.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Long live King Peter!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.90,2:07:39.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Long live King Edmund!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.64,2:07:42.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Long live Queen Susan!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.27,2:07:45.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Long live Queen Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.87,2:08:11.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.50,2:08:15.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll see him again.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.54,2:08:19.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- When?  - In time.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.21,2:08:24.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,One day he'll be here and the next he won't.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.82,2:08:27.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But you mustn't press him.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.59,2:08:31.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,After all, he's not a tame lion.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.26,2:08:34.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.59,2:08:36.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But he is good.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.26,2:08:38.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.50,2:08:42.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You need it more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.49,2:09:40.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Philip?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.72,2:09:43.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not as young as I once was.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.53,2:09:47.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, Ed.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.80,2:09:50.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Just catching my breath.  - That's all we'll catch at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.87,2:09:53.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- What did he say, Susan?  - "Wait in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.30,2:09:56.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll get the stag myself."
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.84,2:10:02.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.19,2:10:10.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems familiar.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.02,2:10:14.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,As if from a dream.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.03,2:10:17.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Or a dream of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.36,2:10:22.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Spare Oom.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.50,2:10:28.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lucy!  - Not again.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.77,2:10:32.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Lu?  - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.25,2:10:44.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,These aren't branches.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.32,2:10:47.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ow! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.39,2:10:50.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- They're coats.  - Susan, you're on my foot!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.53,2:10:52.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Peter, move off!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.80,2:10:54.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,- Stop shoving.  - Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.03,2:10:56.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not on your toe!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.95,2:11:13.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.69,2:11:16.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There you are.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.86,2:11:21.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What were you all doing in the wardrobe?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.53,2:11:26.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't believe us if we told you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.10,2:11:33.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Try me.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.47,2:12:39.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't think you'll get back in that way.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.34,2:12:47.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You see... I've already tried.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.05,2:12:51.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will we ever go back?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.11,2:12:52.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, I expect so.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.95,2:12:56.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But it'll probably happen when you're not looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.46,2:13:01.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All the same...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.16,2:13:03.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,best to keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.65,0:01:41.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙!快过来!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得!你怎么这么不懂事?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.42,0:01:46.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得,快!躲起来!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:47.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快!  - 等下...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.59,0:01:49.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快,离开这里!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.90,0:01:53.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈咪!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.10,0:01:57.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,快跟我来!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.60,0:02:00.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快,快点儿!  - 快跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:02.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.61,0:02:06.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快啊!  - 妈妈!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.08,0:02:08.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 等等,爹地...  - 爱德蒙!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.01,0:02:11.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爱德蒙,别回去!  - 我去拉他回来!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.68,0:02:15.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 彼得,回来!  - 爱德蒙!过来!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.12,0:02:18.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙!快趴下!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.26,0:02:21.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我走,你这傻瓜,快!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.46,0:02:22.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:30.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快过来!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:33.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赶紧!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.91,0:02:37.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你就不能为别人找想吗?真自私!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:41.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就因为你,大家差点送命!  - 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:44.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系的,嘘...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:50.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你就不能乖乖听话吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.40,0:03:04.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可怜可怜穷苦人吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.27,0:03:05.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上帝保佑您,先生...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.67,0:03:07.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,儿童以及撤离人员家属...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:11.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,亲爱的,别脱衣服,好吗?会着凉的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.88,0:03:14.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,够暖和么?乖孩子...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:18.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,和劳拉姑姑问好,再见,亲爱的,我们爱你...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.42,0:03:21.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爹地在的话,是不会让我们走的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.59,0:03:24.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要是爹地在这里就意味着战争结束了,我们当然不用离开!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:27.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,乖乖听哥哥的话,好吗,爱德蒙?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.17,0:03:45.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,答应我,一定照顾好他们...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:46.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会的,妈妈...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:54.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好孩子  - 请大家排队上车!...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:56.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再见,亲爱的!  - 拜拜!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.85,0:03:59.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.99,0:04:03.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,坚强些,懂事点儿...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:06.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧哥哥的手,千万别放开...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.90,0:04:11.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,你们去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.57,0:04:15.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 请大家上车...  - 拜拜,我们爱你...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:23.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,别扯我啊,我知道怎么上火车!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:25.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别拉着我!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.32,0:04:30.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我能看看您的车票吗?请出示车票...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.09,0:04:31.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.16,0:04:35.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可以了,你们可以上车了...  - 好的,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.53,0:04:40.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这边走,请这边走...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.80,0:04:44.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,露西...我们应该团结点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:49.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的,不用怕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:53.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜拜,妈咪!我爱您!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.59,0:05:09.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 再见,亲爱的...  - 我们会想您的!再见!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:12.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我爱您,妈妈!再见!  - 再见...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:15.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 要给我们写信啊,妈妈!  - 我爱你们!...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.14,0:05:59.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,《纳尼亚传奇: 狮子、女巫和魔衣柜》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.53,0:06:17.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,鹅塘站,鹅塘站...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:27.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拉上我的手...我们走吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:32.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,教授知道我们会来吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:35.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,会不会是标签上地点写错了...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:38.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快,噗...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.98,0:07:46.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:54.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 麦克里迪女士?  - 没错儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:59.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就这样?没其他东西了?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:02.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.67,0:08:04.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就我们四个...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:08.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.37,0:08:14.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,驾,乖孩子...驾,驾...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:32.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,科克教授这里不常有孩子光临...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.46,0:08:36.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以...你们必须得乖乖的守些规矩
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:38.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,屋子里禁止高声喧哗...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:43.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...也不准到处乱跑,不可以乱用小升降梯(送饭菜用)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.14,0:08:46.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不准...碰古工艺品!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.01,0:08:50.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,总之,一句话...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:56.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...你们不可以打扰到教授的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:08.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"昨夜,德国轰炸机...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:09.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,突袭了大不列颠领土...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:12.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,轰炸持续了数小时之久..."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.11,0:09:20.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,睡这被子,我觉得痒痒的...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.35,0:09:25.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,战争不会持续多久的,露西,我们很快就可以回家了...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.85,0:09:29.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是啊,如果家还在的话  - 你是不是该上床睡觉了?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.62,0:09:31.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 遵命,"妈妈"!  - 爱德蒙!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:38.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你该去四处瞧瞧,这地方可宽敞了!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.26,0:09:40.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们爱怎么折腾就怎么折腾!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.36,0:09:42.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,明天我们会玩得很开心的!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.77,0:09:45.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.87,0:09:53.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"(器官)消化及循环双重职能的..."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.48,0:09:58.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,认识吗？彼得,"(器官)消化及循环双重职能的..."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.48,0:10:01.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是拉丁文吗?  - 没错儿
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.82,0:10:05.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在拉丁文中,是不是"有史以来最无聊的游戏"的意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:10.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们玩捉迷藏好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:14.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个游戏我们不是玩得挺开心吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:18.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来玩吧,彼得,求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.57,0:10:21.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我真的很想玩儿...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.51,0:10:26.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 1,2,3,4...  - 什么?...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.15,0:10:30.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...5,6,7,8...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.05,0:10:34.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,9,10,11...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.63,0:10:49.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...24,25,26...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:06.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我先找到这里的!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.58,0:12:14.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...75,76,77,78,79,80...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:19.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,81,82,83,84...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.26,0:12:23.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,85,86,85,86,87,88...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:27.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...89,90,91,92...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.77,0:12:31.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,93,94,95...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.94,0:15:26.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是在躲着我么?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:32.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哪里...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.28,0:15:34.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,呃,喔...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:37.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是...我...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:40.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不...我...只是...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.12,0:15:43.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是,呃...不想吓着你...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:50.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不介意我问问...你是谁吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.17,0:15:53.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,我是...我是只半人羊...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.67,0:15:55.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...你呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:58.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是个...年幼的小矮人?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:01.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我才不是小矮人呢!我是个小女孩!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:07.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且,我还是班上最高的呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:14.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说...你是"夏娃之女"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,我妈妈的名字是海伦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.79,0:16:21.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对,可...你是...人类?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.67,0:16:24.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,当然...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你来这里做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:31.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,我躲进了一间空屋的衣橱里...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.64,0:16:33.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"空物"?是纳尼亚的某个地方吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.84,0:16:36.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚?那是什么地方?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:39.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,亲爱的,你正身处其中呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.02,0:16:42.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从这根路灯柱到...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:45.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,位于东海岸的卡尔城堡...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:48.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你所能瞧见的每一棵树木,每一块石头...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.79,0:16:52.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,每一缕冰柱...都是纳尼亚的一部分!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.93,0:16:57.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这衣橱可真大啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.50,0:17:00.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,衣橱?差点儿忘了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:04.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请允许我介绍一下自己,我的名字是汤姆那斯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:08.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你,汤姆那斯先生,我是露西·佩文西
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:16.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 噢,你得握着我的手,还要摇一摇  - 呃...为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:20.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我...我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:22.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,反正大家见面时都这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.07,0:17:36.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,那么...来自"空物"大陆...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:39.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...奇妙"衣橱城"的露西·佩文西小姐...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.44,0:17:44.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是否愿意和我一起喝杯茶呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:47.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,谢谢你的好意,不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.45,0:17:50.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...我可能得回去了...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:55.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我家很近,就在拐角那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.56,0:17:59.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以在温暖的篝火旁品味清香的茶和美味的蛋糕土司
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.13,0:18:02.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有,或许...我们还能吃上点儿沙丁鱼...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:06.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道...  - 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.97,0:18:10.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可是很少有机会能认识新朋友的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.21,0:18:15.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,或许,我可以去你那儿呆一会
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:17.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...只要你有沙丁鱼!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.15,0:18:19.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有好几桶呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.63,0:18:34.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不累吧?  - 嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.54,0:18:43.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,我们到了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:45.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快过来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:53.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你先进去  - 我来帮你拿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:56.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢了  - 噢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.90,0:19:06.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:16.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那...那是我父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.24,0:19:19.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他可真慈祥
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.14,0:19:21.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看起来和你很像呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.08,0:19:24.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.88,0:19:27.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,事实上我和他并不十分相像...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.88,0:19:31.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我爸爸还在打仗呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:36.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我爸爸也去打过仗了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.99,0:19:40.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可那是很久很久以前的事儿了...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.56,0:19:44.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 在这个该死的寒冬之前  - 冬天也不是那么令人讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.50,0:19:49.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家可以滑冰,打雪仗什么的...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.11,0:19:53.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 噢!还有圣诞节!  - 可这儿没有...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.08,0:19:58.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,实际上,我们这儿已经有一百年没过圣诞了...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:20:01.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?已经有一百年没收到过圣诞礼物了?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.95,0:20:04.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,绵延的冬季,虚无的圣诞
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.49,0:20:07.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真是个漫长的冬季啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.09,0:20:11.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过,相信你会喜欢夏季的纳尼亚
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.33,0:20:15.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们常与森林女神联欢...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:19.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不知疲倦地彻夜共舞...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:25.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有音乐!噢,那么动听的音乐!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.08,0:20:29.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你...现在想听听吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:33.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.02,0:20:40.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你听说过...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:44.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- ...纳尼亚摇篮曲吗?  - 抱歉,不大熟悉...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.46,0:20:46.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:51.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为...我将为你演奏的旋律,会让你你耳目一新的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 噢,我该走了  - 可现在已经很迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.06,0:22:23.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我真是个坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.90,0:22:29.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,不
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.30,0:22:32.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我见过最友好的半人羊了!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.14,0:22:35.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是因为你总共也没见过几只
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.81,0:22:40.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,你不可能做过什么坏事的!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.28,0:22:46.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是我做过的事,露西·佩文西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.12,0:22:49.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而是我正在做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.32,0:22:51.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么是"你正在做的事"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.82,0:22:55.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在试图绑架你...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.53,0:22:57.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是白巫婆的指令...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.33,0:22:59.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是她,让这里变成死寂而苍茫的严冬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.93,0:23:01.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她下令...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.57,0:23:04.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们谁在林子里碰到了迷路的人类
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.97,0:23:07.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就得捉住他们,送去给她处置
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.10,0:23:11.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可是,汤姆那斯先生,你才不会这样做呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.95,0:23:19.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是我的朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.92,0:23:26.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在,她或许已经知道你在这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.56,0:23:29.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,森林里布满了她的眼线
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.83,0:23:34.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至有些树木都在帮她秘密监视着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.77,0:23:41.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你能自个儿找到回去的路吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:44.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我想可以  - 那好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.91,0:23:51.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会有事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.45,0:23:55.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,嘿...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.75,0:23:59.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,我很抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.03,0:24:03.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.20,0:24:09.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,留着吧,你比我更需要它
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.90,0:24:15.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,无论发生什么,露西·佩文西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.24,0:24:17.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我都不后悔认识了你这个朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.77,0:24:20.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,与你相处使我体会到百年寒冬中的温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.58,0:24:24.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.18,0:24:25.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.56,0:24:38.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...99,100
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:40.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好了?我来了喔!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.13,0:24:43.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没事儿!我回来了!我很好!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.47,0:24:45.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴!他就要来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.61,0:24:53.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们俩...知道捉迷藏该怎么玩儿吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.11,0:24:55.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不想知道我刚才在哪吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.71,0:24:58.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,本来就该这样啊!这就是为什么他要找你
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.98,0:25:00.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那算我赢了吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.42,0:25:02.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看来露西不想玩儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.65,0:25:05.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我都离开好几个小时了!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.50,0:25:22.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,这里唯一的"树木",就是衣橱的背面...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.61,0:25:26.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要玩捉迷藏就玩捉迷藏,我们可没你那么丰富的想象力
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.71,0:25:33.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可那不是我的幻想!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:35.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.72,0:25:38.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我何必要撒谎呢?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.22,0:25:39.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,我相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.79,0:25:43.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你相信我?  - 当然
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.36,0:25:45.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,记得我提到过的那个碗橱里的广场吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.00,0:25:48.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你闹够了没有?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.23,0:25:50.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还嫌不够乱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.93,0:25:53.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我只不过开个玩笑!  - 你什么时候才能学着懂事点呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.94,0:25:57.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,闭嘴!你以为你是爹地,可你不是!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.78,0:26:03.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,这下可好
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.18,0:26:09.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可是...那儿真的有个新世界呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.55,0:26:12.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊说得没错,露西...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.69,0:26:14.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到此为止吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.39,0:27:52.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.06,0:27:55.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.53,0:27:59.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卟!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.90,0:28:07.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.74,0:28:12.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,希望你不会怕黑喔
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.18,0:28:19.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.46,0:28:27.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.79,0:28:30.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.88,0:28:50.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.71,0:28:53.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.29,0:28:57.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.12,0:29:00.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我相信你了,出来吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.38,0:29:28.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.93,0:29:46.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.81,0:29:54.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.63,0:30:18.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放开我!  - 怎么了,基纳比克?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.30,0:30:20.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让他放我走吧!我没做什么错事!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.64,0:30:23.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你竟敢支使纳尼亚女王?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.11,0:30:24.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我又不知道!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.04,0:30:28.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你会乖乖记牢的!  - 等等!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.66,0:30:41.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字,"亚当之子"?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.82,0:30:44.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,呃,爱德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.16,0:30:48.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么,爱德蒙,你是怎么踏入我的国土的?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.33,0:30:52.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不知道...我就是跟着我的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.40,0:30:56.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你的妹妹?你们有几个人?  - 4个
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.14,0:30:58.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西是唯一曾到过这儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.98,0:31:02.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她还说认识了一个叫汤姆那斯的半人羊朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.98,0:31:06.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得和苏珊不相信她,我也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.12,0:31:10.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙,你觉得冷吧,愿和我坐一块儿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.74,0:31:29.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想喝点儿热饮暖暖吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.91,0:31:34.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好的...谢谢,尊敬的陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.56,0:31:54.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的饮料,阁下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.43,0:31:56.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,您是怎么做到的?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.63,0:31:58.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以变出任何你喜欢的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.64,0:32:02.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,能让我长高些吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.24,0:32:05.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...任何你想吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.71,0:32:08.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,土耳其软糖,可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.44,0:32:36.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.27,0:32:39.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很想见见你的兄弟姐妹
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.61,0:32:41.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.15,0:32:44.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们也没啥特别的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.58,0:32:50.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,我也觉得他们不比你更讨人喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.12,0:32:56.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可是...爱德蒙,要知道我没有自己的孩子...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.26,0:32:58.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而你正是我一直在寻找的男孩...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.29,0:33:03.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望你有一天能成为纳尼亚王子...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.97,0:33:06.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至国王
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.37,0:33:09.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.07,0:33:12.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当然,你得把你的家人一起带来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.68,0:33:13.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.04,0:33:17.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是说,彼得也会成为国王?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.58,0:33:20.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!不,不...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.92,0:33:23.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,国王不是需要仆人的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.22,0:33:27.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我会把他们带来的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.03,0:33:35.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你能透过树林,瞧见那两座小山吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.23,0:33:38.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的宫殿就坐落其中
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.47,0:33:40.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你会喜欢那儿的,爱德蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.50,0:33:44.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在我那儿,有整间整间的土耳其软糖
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.91,0:33:48.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 现在不能再给我变出点儿吗?  - 不!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.78,0:33:53.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在吃太多,到时就没胃口了不是?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.18,0:33:56.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,何况我们应该很快又能见面了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.92,0:34:00.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,希望如此,尊敬的陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.92,0:34:05.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再见,亲爱的,嗯...我会想你的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.13,0:34:10.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,驾!驾!驾!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.01,0:34:19.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.94,0:34:23.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,爱德蒙!你也进来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.81,0:34:26.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这地方很棒吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.55,0:34:30.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你上哪儿去了?  - 去汤姆那斯先生那儿了,他没事!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.85,0:34:34.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,白巫婆还不知道他和我见面的事儿呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.79,0:34:36.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,白巫婆?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.99,0:34:40.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她称自己为纳尼亚女王,可实际上并不是!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.53,0:34:45.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事吧?看起来你脸色很不好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.77,0:34:49.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,你说呢?这儿这么冷...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.77,0:34:53.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们怎么回去?  - 跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.51,0:34:55.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.31,0:34:59.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得,彼得,快醒醒!彼得,快醒醒!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.88,0:35:01.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 它存在!它确实存在!  - 嘘...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.85,0:35:04.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 露西,你在说什么呢?  - 纳尼亚!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.79,0:35:07.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在衣橱里,真的存在我告诉过你的那另外一个世界!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.22,0:35:10.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是不是又做梦了,露西  - 那不是梦!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.39,0:35:14.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我又见到汤姆那斯先生了!还有,这次爱德蒙也到了那里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.57,0:35:20.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你...也见到那只半人羊了?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.91,0:35:27.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,事实上,他并不是和我一起去的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.01,0:35:30.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.68,0:35:35.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你那时在做什么,爱德蒙?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.25,0:35:40.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就自己一个人玩儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.59,0:35:43.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,彼得
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.16,0:35:45.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我真不该和她一起胡闹
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.66,0:35:48.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可是要知道,现在的孩子们都这么调皮...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.66,0:35:52.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,总是不知道何时该适可而止
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.11,0:36:00.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.64,0:36:04.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.12,0:36:13.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们这些不听话的孩子,是不是非要我把你们赶到马厩里!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.86,0:36:20.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,教授...对不起,我告诉过他们不要打扰您的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.90,0:36:24.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系,麦克里迪女士,我相信他们是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.50,0:36:28.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你先帮我给这位小女士泡杯热巧克力吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.87,0:36:32.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来,亲爱的...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.35,0:36:43.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的管家似乎被你们烦得够呛,变得有些歇斯底里了...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.02,0:36:46.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很抱歉,先生,我们保证,以后不会这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.92,0:36:49.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,都是因为我们的小妹妹露西,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.39,0:36:52.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那个哭鼻子的小女孩?  - 是的,先生
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.56,0:36:55.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她很难过...  - 所以就哭鼻子了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.60,0:36:57.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.10,0:37:00.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们自己能解决  - 噢,是吗...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.87,0:37:04.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她说她发现了一片魔幻大陆...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.67,0:37:07.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就在楼上的衣橱中!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.51,0:37:11.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.31,0:37:15.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,呃,楼上的...衣橱
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.69,0:37:18.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西说她在其中发现了一片森林!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.22,0:37:20.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还固执地要我们相信她
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.32,0:37:24.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么样的?  - 我们就像在和一个疯子交谈...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.96,0:37:27.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不,不,不是问她的情况,我想听听那森林是什么样的?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.53,0:37:30.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 您相信她说的是真的?  - 你们不相信她吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.07,0:37:32.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当然不
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.60,0:37:35.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,至少,从理论上说...这不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.20,0:37:38.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在的老师都是怎么教育孩子的啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.14,0:37:40.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙说,她只是在和我们耍调皮
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.14,0:37:42.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,通常他更可信吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.28,0:37:46.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,这是头一回...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.25,0:37:48.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,要是她没有什么不正常,又没有在说谎...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.42,0:37:52.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么我们也最好接受她的说法
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.39,0:37:56.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,您是说,我们该相信她?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.13,0:38:02.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她是你们的妹妹,你们的亲人
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.37,0:38:07.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,至少你们该装作相信她...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.74,0:38:11.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得奋力一掷,成功淘汰又一个击球者!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.84,0:38:13.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.58,0:38:17.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,呜噗!醒醒吧,别做白日梦了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.25,0:38:20.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么不玩捉迷藏了?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.48,0:38:23.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是说玩那游戏太幼稚了么?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.19,0:38:27.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,何况,到户外来呼吸点儿新鲜空气也未尝不是件好事儿!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.66,0:38:30.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,屋子里又不是呼吸不到新鲜空气...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.59,0:38:35.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 准备好了?  - 扔吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.31,0:38:53.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 干的漂亮,爱德蒙  - 球你扔的啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.82,0:38:56.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 又怎么了?!  - 是麦克里迪女士!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.82,0:38:58.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.96,0:39:07.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不行,往回,回去...!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.39,0:39:38.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快过来啊!  - 呃,你不是开玩笑吧?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.51,0:39:51.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,往里面点儿!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.71,0:39:54.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我的脚丫!  - 我没踩到你呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.74,0:39:57.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 往里面点儿  - 别推啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.29,0:40:12.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真不可思议!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.70,0:40:16.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别想太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.23,0:40:19.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不过是你们的臆想罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.80,0:40:22.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想现在即使我们向你道歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.04,0:40:26.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是不够的  - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.11,0:40:31.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不过...这样就没事儿了!  - 噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.02,0:40:36.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.99,0:40:40.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.32,0:40:43.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别闹了!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.43,0:40:46.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你这小骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.33,0:40:50.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们不是也不相信她  - 快向露西道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.90,0:40:55.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快说对不起!  - 好啦!对不起!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.70,0:40:57.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.74,0:41:00.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有些孩子就是不知道何时该适可而止
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.81,0:41:02.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,很有趣
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.34,0:41:04.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,或许我们该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.28,0:41:07.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不四处看看吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.85,0:41:09.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得,这该由露西决定
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.15,0:41:14.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我带你们去见汤姆那斯先生吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.42,0:41:16.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好,那就去汤姆那斯先生那里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.69,0:41:21.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,难道我们得就穿得这么单薄在雪地里走吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.13,0:41:22.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当然不
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.00,0:41:27.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且,我想,教授是不会介意我们借他的衣服穿穿的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.77,0:41:32.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,何况,换个角度想,理论上来说...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.17,0:41:34.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们甚至没有把它们带出衣橱呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.64,0:41:37.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这可是女孩儿的大衣啊!  - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.99,0:42:26.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...好多好多好吃的,我们还可以...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.20,0:42:30.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.57,0:42:33.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.45,0:42:54.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁会这么做呢?!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.84,0:43:15.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"奉纳尼亚女王的旨意...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.38,0:43:19.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,半人羊汤姆那斯因违反纳尼亚律法...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.55,0:43:22.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...通融敌人和勾结人类...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.58,0:43:25.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...而予以就地逮捕!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.95,0:43:29.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,秘密警察首领毛戈里姆...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.49,0:43:31.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...女王万岁!"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.90,0:43:36.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,这下我们可真得回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.20,0:43:37.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可汤姆那斯先生又怎么办呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.93,0:43:40.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果他只是因为和人类接触而被捕
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.87,0:43:44.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- ...我们也无能为力  - 你们还没意识到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.97,0:43:48.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是那个"人类"
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.18,0:43:50.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她一定是发现,他曾经帮助过我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.68,0:43:54.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 或许我们可以请警察来帮忙  - 那些就是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.32,0:43:56.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,露西,我们再想点儿其他办法
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.62,0:43:58.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.12,0:44:00.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说...他是个罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.22,0:44:03.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喂...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.79,0:44:09.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才是不是那头鸟在叫我们?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:54.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这...是头海狸
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.72,0:45:02.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来,小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.82,0:45:04.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来,小东西
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.66,0:45:12.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你是故意想逗我玩儿,我才不想闻你的手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.09,0:45:13.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.50,0:45:14.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.20,0:45:17.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西 佩文西?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.44,0:45:24.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是我...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.38,0:45:35.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,那条手绢是我之前送给汤...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.68,0:45:38.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆那斯,他在被捕之前把它交给了我
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.85,0:45:40.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.09,0:45:43.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.96,0:45:47.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们要做什么?  - 她说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.93,0:45:50.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们凭什么相信他呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.60,0:45:52.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他说他知道半人羊的下落
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.40,0:45:56.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只不过是头海狸,能讲话就已经好奇怪了!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.47,0:45:58.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.27,0:46:00.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对,我们正在讨论呢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.64,0:46:03.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那也最好找个安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.78,0:46:06.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是说,树有耳朵呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.60,0:46:25.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快来,大家都不愿意在夜幕来临前被逮住吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.38,0:46:42.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哎,真要命!看来她已经开始做饭了...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.58,0:46:44.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿就是...玫瑰小窝!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.35,0:46:47.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真可爱!  - 这只是雏形...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.12,0:46:49.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有很多地方还不尽如人意,需要添加和修整...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.52,0:46:51.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过,我相信最后的样子会让大家大为惊叹的!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.03,0:46:56.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是你回来了吗?我好担心啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.43,0:46:59.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要是再让我发现你和袋狸在一块儿,我就...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.04,0:47:01.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.37,0:47:03.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,原来不是袋狸!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.74,0:47:08.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,真没想到,我居然还能盼到这天
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.28,0:47:12.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你也真是,我的皮毛这么乱,有贵客来也不提早通知我一声
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.78,0:47:15.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要是他们愿意等,给你一周的时间都行!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.42,0:47:17.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,快进来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.49,0:47:19.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我们为你们准备些吃的...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.76,0:47:24.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再找些有教养的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.26,0:47:26.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,小心,别碰着头了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.63,0:47:28.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不好意思,家里乱糟糟的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.30,0:47:31.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这家伙总是懒得做家务
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.57,0:47:38.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,景色很美吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.94,0:47:44.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以做些什么,来帮助汤姆那斯呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.75,0:47:47.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就像逮捕令中说的,他们会把他带到白巫婆那里
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.92,0:47:51.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而凡是进那了扇门的,没几个能活着出来
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.85,0:47:54.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来点儿鱼和薯条吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.96,0:47:58.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过还不是完全没希望,亲爱的,乐观点儿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.66,0:48:02.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,噢,当然,总会有办法解决的嘛!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.00,0:48:05.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰正在采取行动呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.91,0:48:14.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁是阿斯兰?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.24,0:48:17.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁是阿斯兰?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.21,0:48:20.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们可真会开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.92,0:48:23.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.75,0:48:29.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们真不知道?  - 我们在这儿还没呆多久呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.29,0:48:31.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喔,在我们眼中,他是不可替代的森林之王...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.76,0:48:35.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...一位睿智的老人,纳尼亚真正的统治者
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.40,0:48:39.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 之前,他离开了许久...  - 不过,终于他又回来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.40,0:48:42.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且,他正在神器石桌附近等待着你们!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.27,0:48:45.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他在等待我们?  - 你们是在开玩笑吧?!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.41,0:48:48.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们甚至连那则预言都没听说过!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.08,0:48:51.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喔,那么...  - 听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.98,0:48:54.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰的归来...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.25,0:48:57.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆那斯的被捕,秘密警察的介入
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.62,0:48:59.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这一切,都是因为你们的出现!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.82,0:49:03.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那么,你是在责备我们么?  - 不!不是在责备你们
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.29,0:49:07.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 反而,我们要感谢你们!  - 传说中,有一则预言...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.23,0:49:10.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"当由亚当赋予生命的血肉之躯...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.20,0:49:13.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,坐上卡尔的宝座之时...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.34,0:49:16.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...那罪恶统治的时代将就此终结!"
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:18.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那听起来可不怎么押韵喔  - ...没错,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.47,0:49:20.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是问题的关键!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.84,0:49:23.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,长久以来,还流传着这样的说法...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.35,0:49:26.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,两位"亚当之子"和两位"夏娃之女"...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.15,0:49:31.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,会推翻白巫婆的罪恶统治,为纳尼亚带来和平!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.79,0:49:35.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而你们认为我们就是传说中的人物?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.39,0:49:38.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,最好就是你们...因为阿斯兰已经为你们募集了军队
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.49,0:49:40.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们的军队?  - 妈妈把我们送走的目的...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.53,0:49:43.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是让我们远离战争
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.17,0:49:46.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你们一定弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.04,0:49:49.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不是英雄  - 我们只是四个来自芬赤雷的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.97,0:49:52.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.17,0:49:55.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们的款待
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.24,0:49:59.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 可我们真得走了  - 不,你们不能就这么离开!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.95,0:50:03.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他说得对,我们得帮助汤姆那斯先生
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.62,0:50:06.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是我们力所能及的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.22,0:50:07.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.72,0:50:10.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可我们真的得回去了,爱德蒙?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.50,0:50:15.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.23,0:50:20.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我真想拧死了那小子!  - 先别急
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.67,0:50:23.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙之前曾来过纳尼亚吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.47,0:50:51.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点儿!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.15,0:51:14.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爱德蒙!  - 嘘,他们会听到的!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.96,0:51:17.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.19,0:51:19.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 放开我!  - 你是在送死!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.69,0:51:22.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不能就这样让他离开!  - 他是我们的亲人!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.20,0:51:25.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他只是白巫婆的诱饵!把你们四个全弄到手才是她的目的!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.33,0:51:29.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 为什么?  - 为了防止预言中的故事变成现实!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.30,0:51:30.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她会杀了你们的!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.68,0:51:43.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这都是你的错  - 我的错?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.02,0:51:47.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要是当初你听我的早些离开,就不会发生这样的事了!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.16,0:51:49.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 难道你当初就知道事情会这样么?!  - 我当然不知道!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.46,0:51:52.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该在还能走的时候走!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.16,0:51:53.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别吵了!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.33,0:51:58.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 争吵是无济于事的!  - 她说得对
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.17,0:52:01.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在只有阿斯兰才能帮助你们的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.00,0:52:04.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那就带我们去见他
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.74,0:53:17.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动,陌生人,否则就要你的命!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.31,0:53:19.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是谁?  - 我是爱德蒙!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.05,0:53:23.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我曾在林子里见过女王,是她让我到这儿来找她的!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.75,0:53:25.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是亚当之子!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.29,0:53:30.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嗯...很抱歉,既然您有幸成为女王的客人...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.39,0:53:33.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...也或者,不是什么好事..
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.00,0:53:39.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这边走
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.96,0:54:02.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在这里等着
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.03,0:54:43.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喜欢吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.26,0:54:48.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,呃,是的,尊敬的陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.64,0:54:52.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你可以...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.81,0:54:56.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我,爱德蒙...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.28,0:55:01.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的姐妹们耳朵不好使吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.42,0:55:03.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.18,0:55:06.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有你的哥哥,他...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.92,0:55:09.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是弱智吗???
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.99,0:55:12.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,我认为是的...但妈妈说...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.50,0:55:16.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么你竟敢自己一个人来?!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.70,0:55:19.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我试过了!  - 爱德蒙,我只让你做这一点点事情
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.50,0:55:22.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们不听我的!  - 你都办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.47,0:55:23.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经把他们带到附近了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.04,0:55:26.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们和海狸们在水坝旁边的小房子里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.92,0:55:35.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.92,0:55:39.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那你也不是一无是处嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.59,0:55:44.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么,我在想
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.50,0:55:50.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你能再给我一些土耳其软糖吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.07,0:55:58.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的客人饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.82,0:56:08.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请过来去吃你的美餐
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.42,0:56:13.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,毛戈林?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.33,0:56:17.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.62,0:56:43.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,妈妈!他们在追我们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.69,0:56:46.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,妈妈!他们在追我们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.26,0:56:49.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 哦,好的  - 她在干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.93,0:56:51.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,你回头会感谢我的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.73,0:56:53.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这会是一个相当长的旅途
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.33,0:56:55.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且海狸在饿的时候会变得很暴躁的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.20,0:56:56.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我现在已经很暴躁了!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.94,0:57:00.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓住他们
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.74,0:57:05.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为我们现在需要果酱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.53,0:57:07.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,除非巫婆给我们准备了面包
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.46,0:57:23.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.94,0:57:42.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,袋狸和我一起挖的这个出口在她的住所附近
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.35,0:57:44.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你告诉我这个是通到你妈妈那里的!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.28,0:57:46.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.28,0:57:49.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们在地道里
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.85,0:57:52.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快,这边!  - 快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.09,0:57:56.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快跑!  - 快!快!快!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.60,0:58:06.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该带一张地图!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.64,0:58:09.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把果酱带上了就没地方放地图了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.21,0:58:18.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.03,0:58:41.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我非常抱歉,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.44,0:58:43.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是我最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.95,0:58:54.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里发生什么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.28,0:58:57.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是背叛巫婆的下场
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.19,0:59:00.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你再向前一步,叛徒,我会把你咬成碎片!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.02,0:59:03.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,放松点,我是好人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.96,0:59:08.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你?哼,你更像是个罪大恶极的人
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.10,0:59:10.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个不幸的家族特征
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.50,0:59:13.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们晚一点再讨论血统问题吧,现在必须得走了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.21,0:59:17.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你到底想干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.78,0:59:26.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,各位好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.22,0:59:30.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们似乎错过了什么  - 别那样跟我说话!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.65,0:59:33.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你跟谁是一伙的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.42,0:59:36.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在找一些人类
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.69,0:59:39.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,人类?在这里?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.10,0:59:41.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那可是有点价值的信息啊,你不这么认为吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.80,0:59:46.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的奖赏就是你的命
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.20,0:59:48.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不算多
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.44,0:59:50.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.54,0:59:53.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还是快告诉我那些人类在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.55,1:00:03.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,北边,他们往北边跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.45,1:00:06.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他们找出来
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.73,1:00:20.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们帮助过汤姆那斯,巫婆比我更早到这里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.74,1:00:23.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,啊,欧!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.44,1:00:24.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.94,1:00:28.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,啊,他们的叫声能比牙齿更恐怖
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.18,1:00:32.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别乱动,你要洗澡的时候会比海狸更糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.68,1:00:34.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这一年中最糟糕的一天
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.25,1:00:36.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢你们的热情款待
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.85,1:00:38.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但是这伤是需要时间来治愈的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.06,1:00:40.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在要走吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.12,1:00:43.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟您在一起是一种快乐,更是一种荣誉,不过时间是短暂的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.79,1:00:46.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且阿斯兰让我去征召更多的部队
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.03,1:00:50.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你已经见到他了?  - 他长得什么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.93,1:00:54.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,像我们大家所听到的一样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.10,1:00:57.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们会非常高兴和他一起跟巫婆战斗的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.71,1:01:00.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们并不打算和什么巫婆战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.58,1:01:03.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但那则预言让我们一起战斗,彼得国王
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.45,1:01:05.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能没有你们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.12,1:01:13.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们只想救回我们的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.25,1:01:39.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.35,1:01:44.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你不想吃那个的话,能不能给我...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.76,1:01:52.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想站起来,但...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.90,1:01:55.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我的腿
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.21,1:02:07.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆那斯先生
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.05,1:02:11.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,正是我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.49,1:02:21.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是露西·佩文西的哥哥  - 我叫爱德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.49,1:02:25.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,你们有着一样的鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.23,1:02:32.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的妹妹还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.57,1:02:36.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她现在安全吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.01,1:02:42.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.19,1:02:52.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的手下把那个水坝翻了个底朝天
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.62,1:02:57.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你的那些家人却不见踪影
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.26,1:03:04.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们哪儿去了?  - 我不知道!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.90,1:03:07.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那么,你已经没什么用了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.60,1:03:11.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下!海狸说了一些有关阿斯兰的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.38,1:03:17.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.22,1:03:20.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.89,1:03:25.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我...  - 他没来过这里,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.72,1:03:27.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他不会知道什么事情的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.63,1:03:33.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在问你...他在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.87,1:03:40.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我...我真的不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.10,1:03:42.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在他们说那些事情之前,我已经离开了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.97,1:03:47.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我想见到您!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.65,1:03:51.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警卫!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.05,1:03:53.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.05,1:03:58.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把那个半人马放了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.66,1:04:02.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,啊!啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.43,1:04:13.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道你为什么会在这里吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.07,1:04:20.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我坚信一个自由的纳尼亚会到来的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.04,1:04:23.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这里...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.41,1:04:26.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...是因为他出卖了你
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.68,1:04:30.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为了一些糖果
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.03,1:04:39.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他带到楼上
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.60,1:04:48.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好我的雪橇
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.34,1:04:51.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙想他的家人了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.43,1:05:16.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰的宿营地在石桌附近
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.00,1:05:20.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 就是过了这条冰冻的河  - 河?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.64,1:05:24.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这条河已经冰冻了一百年了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.74,1:05:31.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 好远啊  - 亲爱的,这可是个世界
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.25,1:05:33.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为一个世界会很小吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.05,1:05:36.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只希望小一点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.10,1:05:56.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗,亚当的儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.75,1:06:06.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,驾!驾!驾!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.41,1:06:35.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,人类们!趁我们还有力气的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.91,1:06:38.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果他再叫我们快一点的话
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.78,1:06:42.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会把他变成一个大绒毛帽子
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.65,1:06:44.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点!跟上!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.05,1:06:48.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他似乎变得有点专横了  - 她在你们的后边!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.86,1:06:50.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 快跑!快!快!  - 跑!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.95,1:07:17.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.06,1:07:21.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快进去!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.79,1:07:23.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快钻进去!快!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.13,1:07:28.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快!快,快,快!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.56,1:07:59.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许她已经走了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.93,1:08:02.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我觉得我应该出去看看  - 不!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.50,1:08:05.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你死了,纳尼亚就没救了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.17,1:08:07.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你也不能死啊,海狸
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.24,1:08:09.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.81,1:08:21.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么声音?那是...  - 嘘,嘘,嘘
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.42,1:08:26.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,出来!都出来!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.26,1:08:29.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望你们都毫发无伤,因为有人想见你们!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.28,1:08:53.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐,先生
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.25,1:08:57.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,自从你们到了这里,露西,我一直很快乐
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.35,1:09:01.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,自从我到了这里,我已经看到了很多新的东西,但这次...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.49,1:09:04.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们以为你是那个巫婆  - 是,很对不起让你们误会了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.03,1:09:10.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但实际上我驾的马车的时间要比巫婆的长
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.60,1:09:13.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我记得纳尼亚这里没有圣诞节
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.80,1:09:16.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的.很久都没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.44,1:09:20.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你们给我们带来了希望,尊敬的各位
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.84,1:09:24.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们的到来减弱了巫婆的法力
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.78,1:09:29.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有,我相信这些东西会让你们高兴的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.72,1:09:33.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,圣诞礼物!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.36,1:09:42.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是火焰花的果汁
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.77,1:09:46.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一滴就可以治愈任何的创伤
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.44,1:09:51.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然我希望你们永远都用不到这个
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.11,1:09:56.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,先生
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.08,1:09:59.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我认为我会变得很勇敢的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.58,1:10:02.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我相信你会的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.35,1:10:05.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但战斗是丑陋的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.43,1:10:14.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.67,1:10:21.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,相信这把弓,它就不会让你失望的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.64,1:10:25.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但战斗是丑陋的事情啊?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.51,1:10:30.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然你看起来并不需要这个
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.78,1:10:34.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你不论何时何地吹响这个
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.72,1:10:36.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,都会有人来帮助你的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.02,1:10:39.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.69,1:10:42.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.73,1:10:47.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你可能要用到这些
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.27,1:10:56.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,先生
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.24,1:11:01.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这些是工具,不是玩具
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.14,1:11:03.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把它们带好并且学会聪明的使用它们
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.08,1:11:07.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在,我必须走了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.85,1:11:10.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,冬天快要结束了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.49,1:11:14.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且在我不在的这一百年,堆积了一大堆我要做的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.29,1:11:20.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰万岁!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.87,1:11:24.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,圣诞快乐!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.34,1:11:29.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 圣诞快乐!  - 圣诞快乐!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.01,1:11:33.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 明年再见!  - 再见!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.41,1:11:35.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我告诉你他是真实存在的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.85,1:11:40.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他说冬天就要过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.72,1:11:42.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们知道那是什么意思吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.39,1:11:46.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有冰了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.87,1:12:00.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们现在必须过河!  - 海狸不造水坝吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.24,1:12:02.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的,我想我游不了那么快  - 快!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.54,1:12:04.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下!你们不再好好想一想了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.87,1:12:07.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们已经没有时间了  - 我只是想让你们现实一点
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.74,1:12:11.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,你只是想让自己显得聪明一点罢了,一如既往
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.75,1:12:48.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下,也许我应该先探探
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.85,1:12:51.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.03,1:13:00.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想你是需要我的帮助,对吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.06,1:13:02.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你永远不知道哪一顿饭是你的最后一餐
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.70,1:13:06.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,特别是你做的饭
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.52,1:13:26.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果妈妈知道我们现在做的事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.56,1:13:27.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈不在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.96,1:13:32.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,欧,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.19,1:13:33.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.00,1:13:38.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快一点!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.68,1:13:50.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.25,1:13:51.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.15,1:13:54.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,孩子,把那把剑放下
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.68,1:13:57.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 否则有人会受伤的  - 别担心我!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.02,1:13:59.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快杀死他!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.46,1:14:03.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,趁你们还能走的时候离开这里,我会放了你们的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.23,1:14:06.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把剑放下,彼得!也许我们应该听他的!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.26,1:14:07.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真是个聪明的女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.00,1:14:11.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要听他的!杀死他!现在就杀死他!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.33,1:14:14.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,欧,不要这样.这不是你们的战争
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.70,1:14:18.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的女王只是想你和你的家人一起离开
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.27,1:14:21.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不要以为那个穿红衣的给了你一把剑
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.14,1:14:24.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你就变成了英雄!快把剑放下!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.78,1:14:27.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,彼得!纳尼亚需要你!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.45,1:14:29.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在你还有机会的时候快杀了他!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.82,1:14:33.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想怎么样,亚当的儿子?我不能像这样永远等下去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.99,1:14:35.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这条河也不能等了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.63,1:14:38.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.64,1:14:48.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快抓紧我!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.96,1:15:50.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好美妙
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.81,1:16:00.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你做了什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.28,1:16:05.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.82,1:16:08.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.92,1:16:15.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有谁看到我的衣服了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.70,1:16:23.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.70,1:16:26.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的哥哥照顾的你很周到的
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.04,1:16:30.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,而且我认为你们不再需要那些冬装了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.71,1:17:09.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里好热啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.35,1:17:15.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦,我现在去检查一下雪橇
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.05,1:17:18.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尊敬的陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.75,1:17:20.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们发现了这个叛徒
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.56,1:17:22.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他在森林边集结您的敌人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.06,1:17:26.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,啊,很高兴你能来访
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.40,1:17:28.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你昨晚对我的狼群帮助很大啊
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.30,1:17:31.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你现在能帮助我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.90,1:17:35.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 原谅我,陛下  - 哦,别浪费时间在这些奉承上
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.84,1:17:40.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想显得很粗鲁,但我并没有在跟你讲话
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.95,1:17:51.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那些人类去了哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.39,1:17:59.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等一下!海狸说了些关于石桌的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.93,1:18:01.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰在那里有一支军队
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.63,1:18:05.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一支军队?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.91,1:18:13.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,爱德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.08,1:18:16.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很高兴这家伙能在死之前...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.88,1:18:20.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- ...见识一下什么是诚实!  - 不要!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.36,1:18:34.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好好想想你是站在哪一边的,爱德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.66,1:18:36.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我这一边...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.80,1:18:40.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...还是他们这一边
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.14,1:18:49.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点去,召集我的部队
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.95,1:18:52.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果这是一场阿斯兰向往的战争...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.65,1:18:56.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...那么我就让这场战争变成现实
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.15,1:20:00.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们为什么都盯着我们看?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.88,1:20:03.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也许他们认为你长得很奇怪
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.92,1:20:12.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿,别乱挠了,你看起来已经很好了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.05,1:20:32.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要见阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.29,1:21:19.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎你,彼得,亚当的儿子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.83,1:21:23.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎你们,苏珊和露西,夏娃的女儿们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.80,1:21:27.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有欢迎你们,海狸们,我非常感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.47,1:21:30.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但另外一个哪儿去了?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.11,1:21:34.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是我们来这儿的原因
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.14,1:21:35.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们需要您的帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.68,1:21:38.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在路上遇到了点小麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.88,1:21:41.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的兄弟被白巫婆给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.28,1:21:44.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓走了?这怎么可能?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.69,1:21:50.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他背叛了他们,陛下
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.19,1:21:53.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那么他背叛了我们所有人!  - 安静,奥利斯
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.06,1:21:56.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我敢肯定他们会解释清楚的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.00,1:22:01.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,都是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.60,1:22:05.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我对他太苛刻了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.74,1:22:10.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都有责任
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.08,1:22:12.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先生,他是我们的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.98,1:22:14.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道,亲爱的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.05,1:22:18.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但这样的背叛更让人无法容忍
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.89,1:22:21.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,事情可能不像你们想象的那么简单
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.83,1:22:33.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是卡尔,四帝之城
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.70,1:22:39.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你会成为其中的王中之王,彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.67,1:22:42.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怀疑那个预言吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.18,1:22:45.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,我坚信...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.08,1:22:50.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰,我不像你想象的那样强大
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.12,1:22:52.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得 佩文西,来自芬赤雷
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.72,1:22:58.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,海狸还告诉我你曾经想把他变成一顶帽子
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.26,1:23:04.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得,这世界上有一种超级魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.87,1:23:06.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,比我们任何一个都要强大
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.60,1:23:08.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它统治着纳尼亚的所有
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.90,1:23:11.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,它决定着事物的是是非非
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.54,1:23:14.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,并且决定着我们每个人的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.31,1:23:17.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们的...还有我的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.75,1:23:19.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我连自己的家人都保护不了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.98,1:23:22.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经把他们安全的带到了这么远的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.82,1:23:24.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,并不是每一个人都来到了这里
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.75,1:23:29.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得,我会尽力救出你们的兄弟的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.16,1:23:32.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我需要你考虑我跟你讲过的话
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.22,1:23:36.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也希望我的家人平平安安的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.80,1:23:43.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的小王子不舒服吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.93,1:23:47.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要松软的枕头吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.17,1:23:53.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,特殊的人就要特别对待
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.91,1:23:57.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这不就是你想要得吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.25,1:24:01.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你看上去像妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.02,1:24:04.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,战争以后妈妈就没穿过这样的裙子了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.36,1:24:10.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该给她带一整箱回去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.49,1:24:13.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我们能回的去的话
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.40,1:24:19.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,刚才不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.10,1:24:24.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们曾经在一起感到很快乐,对吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.64,1:24:28.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对,直到你觉得无聊了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:29.04,1:24:30.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.06,1:24:45.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你哪儿也别想去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.56,1:24:49.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们很累了  - 所以要速战速决
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.30,1:24:55.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.28,1:25:06.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,回来!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.65,1:25:09.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.32,1:25:12.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.69,1:25:16.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经较量过一次了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.73,1:25:19.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都知道你没什么本事
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.36,1:25:21.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得!小心!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.17,1:25:34.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不!放下你的武器,这是彼得的战斗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.38,1:25:38.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你也许认为你是国王
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.58,1:25:40.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你就要死了...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.95,1:25:43.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 像狗一样!  - 小心!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.92,1:25:45.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.24,1:26:04.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,追!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.54,1:26:07.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他会带你找到爱德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.91,1:26:13.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.18,1:26:15.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,擦干你的剑
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.39,1:26:25.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,起身,彼得爵爷
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.13,1:26:27.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚的骑士
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.99,1:26:55.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,牛头怪从左侧进攻
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.76,1:26:58.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巨人预留在后面,矮子打前阵
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.00,1:27:09.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,囚犯逃走了!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.57,1:27:40.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不准备杀我?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.81,1:27:45.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,暂时不会
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.18,1:27:51.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们有事情做
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.31,1:28:24.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.18,1:28:58.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,做过的就无法挽回了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:58.51,1:29:02.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不必向再提过去的事了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.46,1:29:13.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.11,1:29:30.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧?  - 有点累
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.31,1:29:32.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,睡会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.59,1:29:42.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.86,1:29:46.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要乱走
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.88,1:30:02.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚不缺烤面包,爱德蒙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.05,1:30:07.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走时他们一定会为你们打包的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.48,1:30:08.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要走?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.79,1:30:11.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.62,1:30:15.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我向妈妈保证你们的安全
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.99,1:30:18.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我还是可以留下帮助的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.56,1:30:20.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们需要我们
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.10,1:30:24.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们四个
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.40,1:30:26.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西,那太危险了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.37,1:30:28.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你差点就被淹死!爱德蒙差点就被杀死!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.67,1:30:32.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我们更应该留下
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.24,1:30:39.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道白巫婆的能力,也曾帮过她
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.42,1:30:44.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能让这些无辜的人受苦
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.39,1:30:53.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就这么定了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.26,1:30:56.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你去哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.63,1:31:01.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,练习一下
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.09,1:31:27.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙!举起剑来,像奥利斯教的那样
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.23,1:31:29.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 接招!  - 来啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.80,1:31:34.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿!  - 彼德!爱德蒙!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.44,1:31:37.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哇,听话!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.31,1:31:39.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我叫菲利普  - 哦
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.91,1:31:41.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.78,1:31:44.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巫婆要求见阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.71,1:31:48.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她已经在路上了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.12,1:31:50.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚的女王!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.25,1:31:51.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚的女王!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.92,1:31:56.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 滚开,巫婆!  - 孤岛之王!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.89,1:31:59.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不属于这里的!快走吧!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.69,1:32:26.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们中有叛徒,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.66,1:32:32.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他并没有背叛你
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.10,1:32:36.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你忘记纳尼亚的准则了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:36.43,1:32:39.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要跟我提超级魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.00,1:32:43.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,制定它的时候我就已经在这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.91,1:32:49.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那你应该清楚叛徒都是我的人
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.54,1:32:52.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他的血液是我的财产
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.51,1:32:54.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来抢他呀
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.55,1:33:02.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真地认为纯粹的武力可以让我屈服吗...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.89,1:33:04.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...小国王?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.20,1:33:10.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰知道除非我拥有他的血液
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.03,1:33:14.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,否则纳尼亚就会毁灭
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.54,1:33:17.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在烈火和洪水中消亡
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.61,1:33:20.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那个男孩会死...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.91,1:33:24.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在石桌上
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.41,1:33:28.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是传统
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.95,1:33:33.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你胆敢拒绝我
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.92,1:33:35.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.39,1:33:40.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要和你单独谈谈
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.98,1:34:36.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她放弃了要求亚当之子的血液
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.89,1:34:41.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我怎么知道你会信守诺言?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.71,1:35:37.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 苏珊!  - 恩?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.58,1:36:30.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们不早该睡了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.92,1:36:35.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们睡不着
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.32,1:36:38.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,求求你,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.16,1:36:40.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不能和你一起去吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.93,1:36:44.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你们可以送我一程
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.73,1:36:47.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.53,1:37:13.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.33,1:37:16.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我必须一个人走
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.83,1:37:18.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.33,1:37:21.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们相信我,这是必须作的
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.44,1:37:24.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,苏珊
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.27,1:37:26.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢,露西
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.77,1:37:28.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再会
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.41,1:38:38.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看吧,这伟大的雄狮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.10,1:39:05.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要喝奶吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.37,1:39:08.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他为什么不还手?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.68,1:39:12.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,绑起来!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.41,1:39:16.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,绑起来!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.65,1:39:22.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.82,1:39:26.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先把他的毛剃了
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.82,1:39:50.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,带到我这边来
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.48,1:40:54.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道的,阿斯兰
Dialogue: 0,1:40:54.28,1:40:56.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我对你有点失望
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.42,1:41:02.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的认为这样就可以挽救那个人类的叛徒吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.66,1:41:08.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你把你的命给了我
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.60,1:41:10.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,却谁也救不了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:13.47,1:41:15.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱的代价太大了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.28,1:41:26.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.15,1:41:31.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,超级魔法就要平息了!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.29,1:41:37.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.39,1:41:43.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,纳尼亚就是我们的了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.50,1:41:47.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,永远!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.71,1:41:54.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是说
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.94,1:41:57.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,充满失望...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.69,1:42:09.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...和死亡!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.01,1:42:29.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这只大猫
Dialogue: 0,1:42:30.01,1:42:32.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,终于死了!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.07,1:42:38.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,将军!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:38.20,1:42:41.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好...
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.24,1:42:46.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一场不费吹灰之力的战斗吧
Dialogue: 0,1:43:34.33,1:43:36.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太晚了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.06,1:43:39.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他走了
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.25,1:44:01.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他一定清楚他在做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.12,1:44:38.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一边去!一边去!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.79,1:44:41.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.68,1:45:05.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们应该告诉其他人
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.85,1:45:09.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不能就这样把他扔在这里  - 没时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.59,1:45:11.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们一定要知道
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.10,1:45:20.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,树
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.34,1:46:06.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的王子,别着急
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.11,1:46:11.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我从你姐姐那里带来了沉痛的消息
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.43,1:46:28.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她是对的
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.44,1:46:33.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他走了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.74,1:46:40.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只剩你来领导我们了
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.02,1:46:48.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得,外面的军队都愿意听从你
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.39,1:46:51.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不行  - 阿斯兰相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.89,1:46:56.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.54,1:47:08.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巫婆的军队已经很近了,你有什么指令吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.09,1:47:57.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的人和武器都远比我们多
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.79,1:47:59.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,人数赢不了战争的
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.03,1:48:03.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但也能起到帮助
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.89,1:49:36.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不要战俘
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.49,1:49:38.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,斩尽杀绝
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.67,1:50:29.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.55,1:50:38.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看天空!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.18,1:51:07.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:08.31,1:51:09.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,至死不渝
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.82,1:51:17.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为了纳尼亚和阿斯兰!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.53,1:51:23.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.86,1:51:26.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上!为了阿斯兰!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.76,1:53:00.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们该走了
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.26,1:53:08.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很冷
Dialogue: 0,1:53:28.85,1:53:30.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:34.33,1:53:36.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.31,1:53:54.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰在那里?
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.81,1:53:57.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们干了什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:07.83,1:54:09.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,阿斯兰!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:17.60,1:54:20.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们见那女巫杀了你
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.07,1:54:23.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果那巫婆知道牺牲的真正含义
Dialogue: 0,1:54:23.68,1:54:27.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她就会从不同的角度理解超级魔法了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:27.08,1:54:29.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,如果把一个无辜的人
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.78,1:54:32.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当作叛徒杀死
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.08,1:54:35.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,石桌就会裂开
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.42,1:54:39.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,甚至死亡可以逆转
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.16,1:54:41.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们已经发出你死亡的消息了
Dialogue: 0,1:54:41.76,1:54:43.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得和爱德蒙将奔赴沙场
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.03,1:54:45.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要去帮助他们
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.50,1:54:49.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的,但不光是你们
Dialogue: 0,1:54:49.70,1:54:51.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,骑到我背上来
Dialogue: 0,1:54:51.47,1:54:54.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的时间很紧
Dialogue: 0,1:54:54.27,1:54:57.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们捂住耳朵
Dialogue: 0,1:55:17.90,1:55:19.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,射!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:39.55,1:55:41.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好的!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:53.63,1:55:56.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,后退!把他们引到岩石堆!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:56.63,1:56:00.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是信号,冲!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:08.28,1:56:09.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们去哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.96,1:56:21.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓紧!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:22.79,1:56:24.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,退!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:26.20,1:56:27.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,退回来!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.34,1:57:05.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.17,1:59:20.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊,这是...
Dialogue: 0,1:59:20.10,1:59:22.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,汤姆那斯先生!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.21,1:59:26.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须快点搜索这个城堡
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.54,1:59:29.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得需要所有我们能找到的人
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.05,1:59:36.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,啊!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:55.94,1:59:58.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙!人太多了!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.61,2:00:00.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快跑吧!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.24,2:00:03.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,带露西她们回家!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.65,2:00:08.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听见了吗?快走!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:27.74,2:00:29.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得说快跑!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.44,2:00:31.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得还不是国王
Dialogue: 0,2:02:08.54,2:02:09.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不可能!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.38,2:03:25.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.22,2:03:29.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 彼得!  - 彼得!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.19,2:03:37.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.87,2:03:50.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:50.74,2:03:51.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,啊!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.33,2:04:45.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你什么时候才能照我说的做?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:21.19,2:06:24.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,金光闪闪的东部海洋
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.23,2:06:28.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我赐予给你,勇敢的露西女皇
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.49,2:06:55.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伟大的西部森林
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.99,2:07:00.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赐予公正的爱德蒙国王
Dialogue: 0,2:07:01.43,2:07:04.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,耀眼的南部骄阳
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.74,2:07:09.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赐予温柔的苏珊女皇
Dialogue: 0,2:07:10.27,2:07:13.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,晴朗的北部天空
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.54,2:07:17.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我赐予你,
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.31,2:07:19.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,伟大的彼得国王
Dialogue: 0,2:07:23.09,2:07:26.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一日为纳尼亚之帝
Dialogue: 0,2:07:26.12,2:07:29.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,终生为纳尼亚之王
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.43,2:07:31.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,愿你的智慧陶冶我们
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.26,2:07:34.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,直到星星从天堂坠落
Dialogue: 0,2:07:34.47,2:07:36.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得万岁!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:36.90,2:07:39.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德蒙万岁!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:39.64,2:07:42.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,苏珊万岁!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:42.27,2:07:45.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,露西万岁!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.87,2:08:11.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别着急
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.50,2:08:15.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还能见到他
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.54,2:08:19.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么时候?  - 总会的
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.21,2:08:24.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他第一天在,第二天就走了
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.82,2:08:27.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但你不能逼他
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.59,2:08:31.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他毕竟不是只温顺的狮子
Dialogue: 0,2:08:32.26,2:08:34.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,2:08:34.59,2:08:36.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但他很好
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.26,2:08:38.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.50,2:08:42.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你比我更需要它
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.49,2:09:40.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,菲利普,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:40.72,2:09:43.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经不像从前那样年轻了
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.53,2:09:47.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来,爱德蒙
Dialogue: 0,2:09:47.80,2:09:50.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 让我喘口气  - 照这样我们只能捉到这么多
Dialogue: 0,2:09:50.87,2:09:53.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他说什么?苏珊  - "在城堡里等着
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.30,2:09:56.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我自己来"
Dialogue: 0,2:10:00.84,2:10:02.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.19,2:10:10.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看上去很熟悉
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.02,2:10:14.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好像在梦里见过
Dialogue: 0,2:10:15.03,2:10:17.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,梦里的梦里
Dialogue: 0,2:10:20.36,2:10:22.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,"空物"大陆
Dialogue: 0,2:10:25.50,2:10:28.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 露西!  - 不会吧
Dialogue: 0,2:10:29.77,2:10:32.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 露西?  - 来!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:43.25,2:10:44.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不是树枝
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.32,2:10:47.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:47.39,2:10:50.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是大衣  - 苏珊,你踩我的脚了
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.53,2:10:52.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,彼得,闪开!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.80,2:10:54.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别挤!  - 别!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:55.03,2:10:56.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没踩你的脚!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:11.95,2:11:13.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,哦!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:14.69,2:11:16.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在这儿
Dialogue: 0,2:11:18.86,2:11:21.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在衣厨里干什么?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:23.53,2:11:26.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,即使告诉你,你也不会相信的
Dialogue: 0,2:11:32.10,2:11:33.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,试试
Dialogue: 0,2:12:36.47,2:12:39.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不认为你们可以回去
Dialogue: 0,2:12:42.34,2:12:47.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经试过了
Dialogue: 0,2:12:49.05,2:12:51.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还能回去吗?
Dialogue: 0,2:12:51.11,2:12:52.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我期望可以
Dialogue: 0,2:12:53.95,2:12:56.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但可能只会发生在你们没有刻意找它的时候
Dialogue: 0,2:12:59.46,2:13:01.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,2:13:01.16,2:13:03.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也不要放弃希望
